(81871, 3034, 1796, '<td valign="top">this picture says pain to me, not fear, but I wasn''t there. I seem to have a similar problem with my picture. beegee 4</td>', 'this picture says pain to me, not fear, but I wasn''t there. I seem to have a similar problem with my picture. beegee 4', '2002-07-08 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1);
<br/> <br/>So this is what I get for submitting a not-so-obvious pic lol.  I figured that some people wouldn''t get it, but I didn''t think it would be this bad.  Yes, I know it is blurry. <br/> <br/>OK, so it''s a picture of the Grim Reaper reflected in my eye.<br/> <br/>It was so tight because:<br/>1. I didn''t want the eye to be so obvious.<br/>2. I didn''t want the reaper to be too small.<br/>3. I was trying out a new technique.<br/>4. I didn''t want this to be just another picture of an eye that happened to have a reflection in it.<br/> <br/>I agree that it could be sharper, but because of the nature of the fear I wanted to keep it blurry.  In my mind death is not a black and white thing that appears crystal clear and tack sharp.  I know this is difficult to convey just with a picture.<br/> <br/>The title is loosely based on a scene in "The Seventh Seal" where the knight is playing chess with Death.  If I titled it "Grim Reaper in the Shadows" or something I''m sure more people would have understood it... oh well...<br/> <br/>So finally, I realize there are a few things I could have done better, but in general the result I got was the one I wanted.<br/> <br/>-Leigh<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-07-06 23:35:59.</i></td>', 'First, thank you everyone for the comments. So this is what I get for submitting a not-so-obvious pic lol.  I figured that some people wouldn''t get it, but I didn''t think it would be this bad.  Yes, I know it is blurry.  OK, so it''s a picture of the Grim Reaper reflected in my eye. It was so tight because:1. I didn''t want the eye to be so obvious.2. I didn''t want the reaper to be too small.3. I was trying out a new technique.4. I didn''t want this to be just another picture of an eye that happened to have a reflection in it. I agree that it could be sharper, but because of the nature of the fear I wanted to keep it blurry.  In my mind death is not a black and white thing that appears crystal clear and tack sharp.  I know this is difficult to convey just with a picture. The title is loosely based on a scene in "The Seventh Seal" where the knight is playing chess with Death.  If I titled it "Grim Reaper in the Shadows" or something I''m sure more people would have understood it... oh well... So finally, I realize there are a few things I could have done better, but in general the result I got was the one I wanted. -Leigh', '2002-07-15 10:24:00.000000', '2003-07-07 00:35:59.000000', 0),
(84082, 3129, 1485, '<td valign="top">this is a great picture.. but i see nothing to do with fear.  It''s certainly postcard - show the world - quality... but u lose points b/c I see nothing of fear.</td>', 'this is a great picture.. but i see nothing to do with fear.  It''s certainly postcard - show the world - quality... but u lose points b/c I see nothing of fear.', '2002-07-08 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
