(84087, 3129, 509, '<td valign="top">I had that same fear for the longest time (fear of flying)...wait I still have it.  I could also see this as fear of military service...but that''s a bit of a stretch.  What kind of plane is that?  It looks like a Hellcat or a Wildcat to me, maybe even an AT-6 (I''m just guessing) - a closer crop or more zoom on the plane would''ve been nice I think.  Nice job!</td>', 'I had that same fear for the longest time (fear of flying)...wait I still have it.  I could also see this as fear of military service...but that''s a bit of a stretch.  What kind of plane is that?  It looks like a Hellcat or a Wildcat to me, maybe even an AT-6 (I''m just guessing) - a closer crop or more zoom on the plane would''ve been nice I think.  Nice job!', '2002-07-09 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84088, 3129, 2337, '<td valign="top">It took me a LONG to to figure out that you were "afraid" that pilots might need a sign telling them to lower the landing gear.  It would be a better photo if you could have talked a pilot into coming in low without his gear down :)  (Yes, I''m kidding)  Now that I see it, I''ll give you back the points I deducted for missing the challenge... You skirted the challenge, but certainly meet it :)</td>', 'It took me a LONG to to figure out that you were "afraid" that pilots might need a sign telling them to lower the landing gear.  It would be a better photo if you could have talked a pilot into coming in low without his gear down :)  (Yes, I''m kidding)  Now that I see it, I''ll give you back the points I deducted for missing the challenge... You skirted the challenge, but certainly meet it :)', '2002-07-09 01:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
