(898376, 3142, 671, '<td valign="top">This bear was actually about 5 feet away from me, so that is why I couldn''t get him more centered in the frame.  And no, he wasn''t in a zoo.  He was walking beside a backroad on Vancouver Island, and if I''d put my hand out of the car, I could probably have touched him.  Not a tame Yellowstone bear, either!</td>', 'This bear was actually about 5 feet away from me, so that is why I couldn''t get him more centered in the frame.  And no, he wasn''t in a zoo.  He was walking beside a backroad on Vancouver Island, and if I''d put my hand out of the car, I could probably have touched him.  Not a tame Yellowstone bear, either!', '2004-09-08 00:11:04.000000', NULL, 0),
