(81262, 2989, 92, '<td valign="top">Without the title I just don''t see fear</td>', 'Without the title I just don''t see fear', '2002-07-08 03:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81263, 2989, 772, '<td valign="top">Good work with the lighting on this one :)  I wonder if a vertical crop would be better in this shot?  This could allow the whole toy to be visible in the image.  I''m curious about your title... No Fear?  I''m sure you will get comments about that.  I try to exclude the title from my voting unless it adds something to the overall impact of the photo... = 5 - jmsetzler</td>', 'Good work with the lighting on this one :)  I wonder if a vertical crop would be better in this shot?  This could allow the whole toy to be visible in the image.  I''m curious about your title... No Fear?  I''m sure you will get comments about that.  I try to exclude the title from my voting unless it adds something to the overall impact of the photo... = 5 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-08 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
