(81270, 2989, 436, '<td valign="top">It''s probably my ignorance, but my only reaction to this image is "Oh look, a little toy guy."  Since I''m not fearful of little toys, it leaves me cold.  Could the focus have been sharper? Would he have appeared more frightening/frightened if the lighting were different?</td>', 'It''s probably my ignorance, but my only reaction to this image is "Oh look, a little toy guy."  Since I''m not fearful of little toys, it leaves me cold.  Could the focus have been sharper? Would he have appeared more frightening/frightened if the lighting were different?', '2002-07-09 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
