(81272, 2989, 2221, '<td valign="top">funny! it''s like the super-hero says "have no fear o lovely maid" ;-)<br/>maybe you could have cropped more on the right or moved the camere to the left. that way there would be less of the dark area on the right side. negative space on the left side woould be cooler.<br/>nice colors. a bit grainy and blurred though, but still one of my favourites this week.</td>', 'funny! it''s like the super-hero says "have no fear o lovely maid" ;-)maybe you could have cropped more on the right or moved the camere to the left. that way there would be less of the dark area on the right side. negative space on the left side woould be cooler.nice colors. a bit grainy and blurred though, but still one of my favourites this week.', '2002-07-09 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
