(81303, 2990, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is an odd selection for fear. To me this symbolizes bravery, honor and courage. I am not docking points because many people fear war and fear the loss of loved ones. - There is an odd distortion in several areas, mostly on the right.</td>', 'This is an odd selection for fear. To me this symbolizes bravery, honor and courage. I am not docking points because many people fear war and fear the loss of loved ones. - There is an odd distortion in several areas, mostly on the right.', '2002-07-11 02:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
