(81305, 2990, 811, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if you meant for this to be a soft focus, or if it was an accident.  It is too blurry on the right, too sharp on the left.   Also, the colors are a little flat.  Maybe play with a touch of saturation, and boost the contrast/brightness just a touch.</td>', 'I can''t tell if you meant for this to be a soft focus, or if it was an accident.  It is too blurry on the right, too sharp on the left.   Also, the colors are a little flat.  Maybe play with a touch of saturation, and boost the contrast/brightness just a touch.', '2002-07-11 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81306, 2990, 1019, '<td valign="top">more grand than fearful</td>', 'more grand than fearful', '2002-07-11 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81307, 2990, 2678, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but the fact that Arlington National Cemetary would cause you to think about fear is incredible.  I''ve been there multiple times, and like most people I know, it does nothing but instill peacefulness, reverence,  and a thought of those that died to protect me and my families.  I would consider this a very poor choice for an entry as "fear"</td>', 'Nice photo, but the fact that Arlington National Cemetary would cause you to think about fear is incredible.  I''ve been there multiple times, and like most people I know, it does nothing but instill peacefulness, reverence,  and a thought of those that died to protect me and my families.  I would consider this a very poor choice for an entry as "fear"', '2002-07-11 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81308, 2990, 878, '<td valign="top">I hate to say this but this photo is almost peaceful.  It may be the nice colors of the sky and the soft focus, BW may of been a bit more dramatic with a lower camera angle.</td>', 'I hate to say this but this photo is almost peaceful.  It may be the nice colors of the sky and the soft focus, BW may of been a bit more dramatic with a lower camera angle.', '2002-07-12 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81309, 2990, 436, '<td valign="top">The shot is similiar to, but offers nothing new, on a scene i''ve seen many times before.  The subject is quite strong, But something''s off on the focus on the right (for my screen) and I wish you''d taken a new view:  from the ground, along the edge of a tombstone, from a tree, one with fewer trees.  It just seems too snapshoty for a higher score.</td>', 'The shot is similiar to, but offers nothing new, on a scene i''ve seen many times before.  The subject is quite strong, But something''s off on the focus on the right (for my screen) and I wish you''d taken a new view:  from the ground, along the edge of a tombstone, from a tree, one with fewer trees.  It just seems too snapshoty for a higher score.', '2002-07-12 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
