(81387, 2998, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting!  I can see where this would cause fear :)  The concentric circles adds a nice element to this photo also.  I"m not sure what camera was used to do this, but the expsoure needs a little tweaking possibly.  Exposing images that have distinctly dark and light areas (like in the shadows challenge) is not easy to do.  If you have spot metering, you need to look for a ''grey'' area that is somewhere in the middle of light and dark to set your exposure :) = 5 - jmsetzler</td>', 'Interesting!  I can see where this would cause fear :)  The concentric circles adds a nice element to this photo also.  I"m not sure what camera was used to do this, but the expsoure needs a little tweaking possibly.  Exposing images that have distinctly dark and light areas (like in the shadows challenge) is not easy to do.  If you have spot metering, you need to look for a ''grey'' area that is somewhere in the middle of light and dark to set your exposure :) = 5 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-08 19:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
