(81402, 2998, 811, '<td valign="top">Though this picture pulls you to a definite point of focus, it still seems a little flat.  Did you play with angle, or having the "light at the end" in a different place in the frame?  Also, if possible, taking it with more resolution and cropping out the edges would have helped you get rid of the washed out areas around the edge. karmat</td>', 'Though this picture pulls you to a definite point of focus, it still seems a little flat.  Did you play with angle, or having the "light at the end" in a different place in the frame?  Also, if possible, taking it with more resolution and cropping out the edges would have helped you get rid of the washed out areas around the edge. karmat', '2002-07-13 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
