(81548, 3008, 2, '<td valign="top">hah! ... No, you needn''t say more...</td>', 'hah! ... No, you needn''t say more...', '2002-07-14 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81549, 3008, 117, '<td valign="top">This photograph that I took was an example of nuclear imagination. I couldn''t very well take a picture of a nuclear bomb. I wanted to make a statement about nuclear destruction in a photograph that could happen without having the destruction. I have lived 51 years in fear, or not knowing about atomic power. No, the reactors I believe are not online because they were made like 3-mile island and we know what happened there. I was in awe of the structures and it is too bad that nuclear power is not 100 % safe. Then again you still have the atomic waste that is radioactive and no where to put it safely.</td>', 'This photograph that I took was an example of nuclear imagination. I couldn''t very well take a picture of a nuclear bomb. I wanted to make a statement about nuclear destruction in a photograph that could happen without having the destruction. I have lived 51 years in fear, or not knowing about atomic power. No, the reactors I believe are not online because they were made like 3-mile island and we know what happened there. I was in awe of the structures and it is too bad that nuclear power is not 100 % safe. Then again you still have the atomic waste that is radioactive and no where to put it safely.', '2002-07-15 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(81550, 3008, 917, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this one bypassed me completely. I thought you might be saying something about industrial pollution, but these are cooling towers not smoke stacks. Perhaps some radiation hazard sign in the foreground might have helped.</td>', 'I''m afraid this one bypassed me completely. I thought you might be saying something about industrial pollution, but these are cooling towers not smoke stacks. Perhaps some radiation hazard sign in the foreground might have helped.', '2002-07-15 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
