(81667, 3023, 2337, '<td valign="top">I bet you''re hearing "too dark" a lot and are sick of it by now, so I''ll resist the temptation.  It definitely has a ''spooky'' feeling to it, but I''m really not sure what I''m looking at.  The dot in the center grabs my eye every time I look, but it''s just a dot to me.</td>', 'I bet you''re hearing "too dark" a lot and are sick of it by now, so I''ll resist the temptation.  It definitely has a ''spooky'' feeling to it, but I''m really not sure what I''m looking at.  The dot in the center grabs my eye every time I look, but it''s just a dot to me.', '2002-07-09 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
