(81688, 3026, 2343, '<td valign="top">I like it but I thought I had the corner on putting Barbie in stange places.  I think more headlines and photo''s of events in the background would be better.  Good photo.</td>', 'I like it but I thought I had the corner on putting Barbie in stange places.  I think more headlines and photo''s of events in the background would be better.  Good photo.', '2002-07-08 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
