(81690, 3026, 117, '<td valign="top">i feel like i was held hostage</td>', 'i feel like i was held hostage', '2002-07-08 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81691, 3026, 811, '<td valign="top">Today''s headlines can be scary.  Interesting depiciton.  Good focus throughout the picture.  If it was possible to blur the headlines, just a little so they would still be readable, it may have given the picture some depth.   Of course, then you would have gotten comments that the blur was bad.  Oh well could be worse, I could be reading the newspaper. :-)  karmat</td>', 'Today''s headlines can be scary.  Interesting depiciton.  Good focus throughout the picture.  If it was possible to blur the headlines, just a little so they would still be readable, it may have given the picture some depth.   Of course, then you would have gotten comments that the blur was bad.  Oh well could be worse, I could be reading the newspaper. :-)  karmat', '2002-07-08 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81692, 3026, 1944, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''re photo  has great meaning to you, but I''m having trouble connecting the subjects and the title to the background. Very good photo technically though, so I''m adding a point because I''m tired of looking at fuzzy pictures. Shey.</td>', 'I''m sure you''re photo  has great meaning to you, but I''m having trouble connecting the subjects and the title to the background. Very good photo technically though, so I''m adding a point because I''m tired of looking at fuzzy pictures. Shey.', '2002-07-09 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81693, 3026, 2373, '<td valign="top">inapropriat</td>', 'inapropriat', '2002-07-09 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81694, 3026, 1856, '<td valign="top">hmmm.  I like the photo quality but I''m unsure of it''s message.  It seems like there are two separate and conflicting things going on here.  1.  Take the guy with the gun out of the picture and she''s afraid of the alleged ''world deterioration'' and is begging a friend to help her escape. 2.  Ignore the world is falling apart background theme and she''s begging for her life...she''s being cooperative by putting her hands in the air.  So, to me...title''s off and you should have portrayed a single idea more clearly.  I definitely see fear in either situation 1 or 2 so I''ll give you a 6  Lisa  :)</td>', 'hmmm.  I like the photo quality but I''m unsure of it''s message.  It seems like there are two separate and conflicting things going on here.  1.  Take the guy with the gun out of the picture and she''s afraid of the alleged ''world deterioration'' and is begging a friend to help her escape. 2.  Ignore the world is falling apart background theme and she''s begging for her life...she''s being cooperative by putting her hands in the air.  So, to me...title''s off and you should have portrayed a single idea more clearly.  I definitely see fear in either situation 1 or 2 so I''ll give you a 6  Lisa  :)', '2002-07-09 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81695, 3026, 1831, '<td valign="top">creative. I think I get it ;-) Dogman"6"</td>', 'creative. I think I get it ;-) Dogman"6"', '2002-07-09 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81696, 3026, 2261, '<td valign="top">Funny not fearsome. In another task this would score higher.</td>', 'Funny not fearsome. In another task this would score higher.', '2002-07-09 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81697, 3026, 2302, '<td valign="top">photo quality = 5, good focus. I like that you can read the text on the articles. meeting challenge = 3. I guess the gun at her head pushes this over the top for me. I think it would have been better without it there. total = 8</td>', 'photo quality = 5, good focus. I like that you can read the text on the articles. meeting challenge = 3. I guess the gun at her head pushes this over the top for me. I think it would have been better without it there. total = 8', '2002-07-09 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81698, 3026, 472, '<td valign="top">this is a very well shot and hilarious but serious statement. i like it.</td>', 'this is a very well shot and hilarious but serious statement. i like it.', '2002-07-09 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81699, 3026, 2638, '<td valign="top">great imagination!</td>', 'great imagination!', '2002-07-09 23:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
