(81702, 3026, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think the presence of the gun is unnecessary, and in some ways contradicts the basic premise set up by the doll and papers -- the far that the world''s collapsing and that "there''s no way out."  Another perspective is that your title hurts you here -- "Don''t Shoot" would work better with the image as-is.</td>', 'I think the presence of the gun is unnecessary, and in some ways contradicts the basic premise set up by the doll and papers -- the far that the world''s collapsing and that "there''s no way out."  Another perspective is that your title hurts you here -- "Don''t Shoot" would work better with the image as-is.', '2002-07-10 05:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81703, 3026, 806, '<td valign="top">I personally think the articles alone would''ve made the point.</td>', 'I personally think the articles alone would''ve made the point.', '2002-07-10 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81704, 3026, 2647, '<td valign="top">I fear the headlines and the press more than the dolls</td>', 'I fear the headlines and the press more than the dolls', '2002-07-10 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
