(81721, 3027, 2152, '<td valign="top">This isn''t what I think of when I think "trapped."  There''s also some compression around the leaves.  Saving at a larger file size should eliminate this.</td>', 'This isn''t what I think of when I think "trapped."  There''s also some compression around the leaves.  Saving at a larger file size should eliminate this.', '2002-07-08 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
