(81735, 3027, 308, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  Imagining looking up like this makes me feel dizzy and I think that helps convey the fear well.  Good work.</td>', 'I like this one.  Imagining looking up like this makes me feel dizzy and I think that helps convey the fear well.  Good work.', '2002-07-10 20:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81736, 3027, 2582, '<td valign="top">as a landscape pic, its fine.but cannot see the conection to fear.</td>', 'as a landscape pic, its fine.but cannot see the conection to fear.', '2002-07-11 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81737, 3027, 2052, '<td valign="top">i really don''t understand this</td>', 'i really don''t understand this', '2002-07-12 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81738, 3027, 2686, '<td valign="top">???</td>', '???', '2002-07-12 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81739, 3027, 1169, '<td valign="top">i don''t get it</td>', 'i don''t get it', '2002-07-13 04:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81740, 3027, 878, '<td valign="top">This is a nice clean shot but after looking at it and trying to see the sense of trapped I am only feeling calmness from the shot, not fear.</td>', 'This is a nice clean shot but after looking at it and trying to see the sense of trapped I am only feeling calmness from the shot, not fear.', '2002-07-13 16:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81741, 3027, 2221, '<td valign="top">nice idea. trapped in the woods really can be a fear for us townspeople ;-)<br/>but the photo has some flaws. e.g. the trees are all equally dark but the sky is blue and white (clouds). so the photo looks (at least to me) like as if you wanted to show the nice sky and the trees are only framing to it. so a different white balance where the trees are lighter and better seen (different shades of green) and the sky therefore is a bit overexposured would be better.<br/>less DOF would also be better to put more focus on the trees. but i see that a wider aperture would have been difficult with the lighting conditions.<br/>a setup where the trees really frame the photo and only a little part in the middle is empty would express this "trapped" feeling more. now there is some empty space on the bottom of the photo being contrary to "trapped".<br/></td>', 'nice idea. trapped in the woods really can be a fear for us townspeople ;-)but the photo has some flaws. e.g. the trees are all equally dark but the sky is blue and white (clouds). so the photo looks (at least to me) like as if you wanted to show the nice sky and the trees are only framing to it. so a different white balance where the trees are lighter and better seen (different shades of green) and the sky therefore is a bit overexposured would be better.less DOF would also be better to put more focus on the trees. but i see that a wider aperture would have been difficult with the lighting conditions.a setup where the trees really frame the photo and only a little part in the middle is empty would express this "trapped" feeling more. now there is some empty space on the bottom of the photo being contrary to "trapped".', '2002-07-13 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81742, 3027, 1078, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I understand what you were trying to convey, but I can''t get a sense of being trapped from a shot of tree branch silhouettes overhead.  Trees generally desginate open space -- as does the blue sky and puffy white clouds.  I think you might have delivered the concept better with some other silhouette.</td>', 'Sorry, I understand what you were trying to convey, but I can''t get a sense of being trapped from a shot of tree branch silhouettes overhead.  Trees generally desginate open space -- as does the blue sky and puffy white clouds.  I think you might have delivered the concept better with some other silhouette.', '2002-07-14 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81743, 3027, 2, '<td valign="top">Trapped, looking up at the sky under branches?</td>', 'Trapped, looking up at the sky under branches?', '2002-07-14 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81744, 3028, 1779, '<td valign="top">cool!  : ) what''s on the bottom...?</td>', 'cool!  : ) what''s on the bottom...?', '2002-07-08 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81745, 3028, 2373, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the effect. But fear ey ? Maybe ?</td>', 'I like the idea and the effect. But fear ey ? Maybe ?', '2002-07-08 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81746, 3028, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, I guess you had to be there.  I like the shot, but better for next week''s challenge.  5 Swash</td>', 'Interesting effect, I guess you had to be there.  I like the shot, but better for next week''s challenge.  5 Swash', '2002-07-08 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81747, 3028, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good job on the creative concept and interesting effect. I liked this except for the dark stuff at the bottom. I don''t know if cropping would ruin the shot or not.</td>', 'Good job on the creative concept and interesting effect. I liked this except for the dark stuff at the bottom. I don''t know if cropping would ruin the shot or not.', '2002-07-08 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81748, 3028, 2109, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  How did you do this?  Very enticing and creative.</td>', 'Whoa!  How did you do this?  Very enticing and creative.', '2002-07-09 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81749, 3028, 2380, '<td valign="top">Is this digitally altered ? Good shot though</td>', 'Is this digitally altered ? Good shot though', '2002-07-09 04:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81750, 3028, 737, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide what I like about this - but I do. Good job.</td>', 'I can''t decide what I like about this - but I do. Good job.', '2002-07-09 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81751, 3028, 2261, '<td valign="top">The colours do not work!</td>', 'The colours do not work!', '2002-07-09 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81752, 3028, 2638, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2002-07-09 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81753, 3028, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting work of art. I dont understand the title yetINSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(81872, 3034, 2337, '<td valign="top">Ouch! is he alright?  I like the flare of the sparklers and especially the smoke, but the background is a bit crowded... Of course posing him with a less crowded background and saying "Ok, burn your eye again" would not have been an option.  I think with the aid of Printshop type software to blur the background, this might be a great shot.</td>', 'Ouch! is he alright?  I like the flare of the sparklers and especially the smoke, but the background is a bit crowded... Of course posing him with a less crowded background and saying "Ok, burn your eye again" would not have been an option.  I think with the aid of Printshop type software to blur the background, this might be a great shot.', '2002-07-09 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81873, 3034, 1325, '<td valign="top">So real to life.</td>', 'So real to life.', '2002-07-09 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81874, 3034, 734, '<td valign="top">I hope hes ok!</td>', 'I hope hes ok!', '2002-07-09 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81875, 3034, 772, '<td valign="top">i love sparklers.. they are definitely dangerous too :) = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'i love sparklers.. they are definitely dangerous too :) = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-09 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81876, 3034, 1944, '<td valign="top">Nice job of telling a story. Shey.</td>', 'Nice job of telling a story. Shey.', '2002-07-10 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81877, 3034, 641, '<td valign="top">Good point. I think If you could get rid of the car in the back ground and the extra people this would be even better.</td>', 'Good point. I think If you could get rid of the car in the back ground and the extra people this would be even better.', '2002-07-10 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81878, 3034, 2172, '<td valign="top">I can see the fear from a parent''s perspective, but this doesn''t speak to me-sorry.  Still good work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I can see the fear from a parent''s perspective, but this doesn''t speak to me-sorry.  Still good work.Ruthann', '2002-07-10 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81879, 3034, 1313, '<td valign="top">Pretty good.</td>', 'Pretty good.', '2002-07-10 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81880, 3034, 308, '<td valign="top">Now this is something I can relate to!  Nice work.</td>', 'Now this is something I can relate to!  Nice work.', '2002-07-10 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81881, 3034, 715, '<td valign="top">Good one!  Actually I think it''s the only photo in the challenge that shows real  fear.</td>', 'Good one!  Actually I think it''s the only photo in the challenge that shows real  fear.', '2002-07-11 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81882, 3034, 1054, '<td valign="top">This feels like more of a snapshot than a composed photograph, and seems more like consequences than fear to me.</td>', 'This feels like more of a snapshot than a composed photograph, and seems more like consequences than fear to me.', '2002-07-12 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81883, 3034, 1379, '<td valign="top">Poor guy!  I know that smoke is burning his eyes, but the image makes me laugh out loud!  So funny!</td>', 'Poor guy!  I know that smoke is burning his eyes, but the image makes me laugh out loud!  So funny!', '2002-07-13 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81884, 3034, 527, '<td valign="top">It just looks like kids having fun to me. No fear for me.<br/><br/>4  -Tim</td>', 'It just looks like kids having fun to me. No fear for me.4  -Tim', '2002-07-13 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81885, 3034, 878, '<td valign="top">If another shot was taken of this scene I feel it would of had more impact.  Perhaps if the image was not so busy.  Taking the shot at the childs eye level may of worked better. <br/><br/></td>', 'If another shot was taken of this scene I feel it would of had more impact.  Perhaps if the image was not so busy.  Taking the shot at the childs eye level may of worked better. ', '2002-07-13 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81886, 3034, 2, '<td valign="top">You''re stretching a little :)  I don''t think the shot really works for the challenge, but the kid''s expression is great.  I''d like this photo much better with just him in the shot.</td>', 'You''re stretching a little :)  I don''t think the shot really works for the challenge, but the kid''s expression is great.  I''d like this photo much better with just him in the shot.', '2002-07-14 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81887, 3034, 1078, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m guessing this is staged -- and that''s totally OK -- but what scares ME is if this wasn''t staged, the kid really does have something in his eye, and you pulled out your camera and took a picture of it.  :-)  Love the glare of the sparklers, and for what ever reason, the hiding behind the hand works.  I wish I couldn''t see the car and that the kids in the background were a little more evenly distributed across that background space.</td>', 'OK, I''m guessing this is staged -- and that''s totally OK -- but what scares ME is if this wasn''t staged, the kid really does have something in his eye, and you pulled out your camera and took a picture of it.  :-)  Love the glare of the sparklers, and for what ever reason, the hiding behind the hand works.  I wish I couldn''t see the car and that the kids in the background were a little more evenly distributed across that background space.', '2002-07-14 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81888, 3034, 811, '<td valign="top">I think this picture would have been more appealing if the frame had been filled with the young boy, so that the others who were having a good time didn''t show.  Also, there is something about cutting your subject off at the knees that is disconcerting.  It looks like an accident, even if it is on purpose.  Something I have found that is effective when taking pictures of young people is to get down "on their level."  Having said all of that, this is a good "grab" shot.  Way to be at the right place at the right itme.  I love the expression on his face, and how it seems that though he''s not real pleased with the situation, he will not let go.  If this shot is set up, you have a marvelous actor there!</td>', 'I think this picture would have been more appealing if the frame had been filled with the young boy, so that the others who were having a good time didn''t show.  Also, there is something about cutting your subject off at the knees that is disconcerting.  It looks like an accident, even if it is on purpose.  Something I have found that is effective when taking pictures of young people is to get down "on their level."  Having said all of that, this is a good "grab" shot.  Way to be at the right place at the right itme.  I love the expression on his face, and how it seems that though he''s not real pleased with the situation, he will not let go.  If this shot is set up, you have a marvelous actor there!', '2002-07-15 00:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81889, 3034, 1543, '<td valign="top">thanks to everyone for their comments.  this was a candid shot.  the boy in the foreground was actually scared.  he had never held a sparkler before and covered his eyes screaming until the sparkler went out.  he was not hurt or burned in any way. i wouldn''t use his pain for a photo contest.  i felt i did meet the fear challenge; his fear was there. ;-)</td>', 'thanks to everyone for their comments.  this was a candid shot.  the boy in the foreground was actually scared.  he had never held a sparkler before and covered his eyes screaming until the sparkler went out.  he was not hurt or burned in any way. i wouldn''t use his pain for a photo contest.  i felt i did meet the fear challenge; his fear was there. ;-)', '2002-07-15 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(81890, 3035, 1877, '<td valign="top">Would have been cool if the popcorn was being tossed up...</td>', 'Would have been cool if the popcorn was being tossed up...', '2002-07-08 01:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81891, 3035, 2279, '<td valign="top">whoa.</td>', 'whoa.', '2002-07-08 04:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81892, 3035, 1330, '<td valign="top">funny</td>', 'funny', '2002-07-08 07:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81893, 3035, 917, '<td valign="top">Um, some problems with the narrative: Why is the bloke reacting when he hasnt been stabbed yet? Why is he looking at the camera? He is moving, but the popcorn isnt flying. Why is this happening in daylight and not at night? The movie is missing from the photo.</td>', 'Um, some problems with the narrative: Why is the bloke reacting when he hasnt been stabbed yet? Why is he looking at the camera? He is moving, but the popcorn isnt flying. Why is this happening in daylight and not at night? The movie is missing from the photo.', '2002-07-08 09:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81894, 3035, 1882, '<td valign="top">well, at least he wasn''t totally NAKED, for once!</td>', 'well, at least he wasn''t totally NAKED, for once!', '2002-07-08 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81895, 3035, 1569, '<td valign="top">This is great--just a little tighter crop on the right..Don''t need the doorway.</td>', 'This is great--just a little tighter crop on the right..Don''t need the doorway.', '2002-07-08 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81896, 3035, 2247, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  Your pic makes my palms and soles of my feet sweat!</td>', 'Good composition.  Your pic makes my palms and soles of my feet sweat!', '2002-07-08 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81897, 3035, 1759, '<td valign="top">Haven''t I seen this face somewhere before? This works and it made me laugh too. Good job. Now, pass that popcorn please.</td>', 'Haven''t I seen this face somewhere before? This works and it made me laugh too. Good job. Now, pass that popcorn please.', '2002-07-08 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81898, 3035, 2380, '<td valign="top">sorry but it is too unnatural</td>', 'sorry but it is too unnatural', '2002-07-09 06:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81899, 3035, 2310, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but you do not look frightened.  I am not frightened and the composition could use some work.  The right side is much too empty...</td>', 'I''m sorry but you do not look frightened.  I am not frightened and the composition could use some work.  The right side is much too empty...', '2002-07-09 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81900, 3035, 2140, '<td valign="top">lookout behind you!</td>', 'lookout behind you!', '2002-07-09 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81901, 3035, 1, '<td valign="top">Your setup is rather poor...  Centering, clipping, lots of dead space, poor lighting.  The guy looks more so happy than frightened.  And the guy with the knife doesn''t seem very scary.</td>', 'Your setup is rather poor...  Centering, clipping, lots of dead space, poor lighting.  The guy looks more so happy than frightened.  And the guy with the knife doesn''t seem very scary.', '2002-07-09 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81902, 3035, 741, '<td valign="top">One of the few that made me smile!  Couls have done with a tighter crop - the tables on the lhs and door on the right don''t add anything and are distracting because the DOF is so great.</td>', 'One of the few that made me smile!  Couls have done with a tighter crop - the tables on the lhs and door on the right don''t add anything and are distracting because the DOF is so great.', '2002-07-09 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81903, 3035, 2505, '<td valign="top">=)</td>', '=)', '2002-07-09 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81904, 3035, 2370, '<td valign="top">funny!</td>', 'funny!', '2002-07-09 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81905, 3035, 2261, '<td valign="top">The most fearsome thing in this shot is the amount of popcorn all for one person!</td>', 'The most fearsome thing in this shot is the amount of popcorn all for one person!', '2002-07-09 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81906, 3035, 1897, '<td valign="top">Kill him! KEEELLLL HEEEMMMM!<br/><br/>This would have been more effective with better focus, and better lighting.  Moodier lighting, like it was taken at night.</td>', 'Kill him! KEEELLLL HEEEMMMM!This would have been more effective with better focus, and better lighting.  Moodier lighting, like it was taken at night.', '2002-07-09 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81907, 3035, 1005, '<td valign="top">The popcorn looks sharp, so why doesn''t the rest look as sharp?  Higher fear score than most. 6 Swash</td>', 'The popcorn looks sharp, so why doesn''t the rest look as sharp?  Higher fear score than most. 6 Swash', '2002-07-09 20:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81908, 3035, 772, '<td valign="top">dude... watch out behind you !!! = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'dude... watch out behind you !!! = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-09 22:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81909, 3035, 2638, '<td valign="top">funny</td>', 'funny', '2002-07-09 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81910, 3035, 811, '<td valign="top">I think the room needs to be a little darker, just to set the mood.  What i like is the way the knifeman is looking at the camera and the victim is not.</td>', 'I think the room needs to be a little darker, just to set the mood.  What i like is the way the knifeman is looking at the camera and the victim is not.', '2002-07-09 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81911, 3035, 2302, '<td valign="top">meeting challenge = 4 photo quality = 3 seems to be too much space where nothing is happening here. total = 7</td>', 'meeting challenge = 4 photo quality = 3 seems to be too much space where nothing is happening here. total = 7', '2002-07-10 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81912, 3035, 2337, '<td valign="top">Initially voted this low, but I''m seeing the fun now :)  Had it been me, I would have used a darker room and although it would have made a mess, have the popcorn flying.  bumping you up to 5...</td>', 'Initially voted this low, but I''m seeing the fun now :)  Had it been me, I would have used a darker room and although it would have made a mess, have the popcorn flying.  bumping you up to 5...', '2002-07-10 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81913, 3035, 2647, '<td valign="top">hmmm</td>', 'hmmm', '2002-07-10 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81914, 3035, 806, '<td valign="top">Needs less light, and the bad guy needs not to be looking at the camera.</td>', 'Needs less light, and the bad guy needs not to be looking at the camera.', '2002-07-10 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81915, 3035, 1054, '<td valign="top">Food idea and reasonably well composed, but it looks a little too posed. Perhaps if the popcorn were flying through the air this would work better.</td>', 'Food idea and reasonably well composed, but it looks a little too posed. Perhaps if the popcorn were flying through the air this would work better.', '2002-07-11 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81916, 3035, 738, '<td valign="top">lose some weight ya fat thing ya! maybe your wife would lose some too!!!!</td>', 'lose some weight ya fat thing ya! maybe your wife would lose some too!!!!', '2002-07-11 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81917, 3035, 2052, '<td valign="top">oh god!  is this the fat guy who''s always naked?  wish you''d keep your friggin clothes on; you might get some better scores!</td>', 'oh god!  is this the fat guy who''s always naked?  wish you''d keep your friggin clothes on; you might get some better scores!', '2002-07-12 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81918, 3035, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think it would work better if the assailant were "implied" instead of rght there (say with a looming shadow). Or, maybe have the arm and knife appear to be reaching out of the screen toward the "viewer."</td>', 'I think it would work better if the assailant were "implied" instead of rght there (say with a looming shadow). Or, maybe have the arm and knife appear to be reaching out of the screen toward the "viewer."', '2002-07-13 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(81919, 3035, 671, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge 10 composition 5 lighting 4 focus 5 total 6</td>', 'meets the challenge 10 composition 5 lighting 4 focus 5 total 6', '2002-07-13 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
