(82058, 3042, 1005, '<td valign="top">A little broader depth of field would have been nice, center of subject in good focus.  This is an interestesting angle, and a higher one wouldn''t have been as in your face scary, but I still wonder what the back half of this guy looks like.  2nd best spider shot.  8 Swash</td>', 'A little broader depth of field would have been nice, center of subject in good focus.  This is an interestesting angle, and a higher one wouldn''t have been as in your face scary, but I still wonder what the back half of this guy looks like.  2nd best spider shot.  8 Swash', '2002-07-10 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
