(82061, 3042, 587, '<td valign="top">Oh my god I bet you are getting a lot of "YUCKS!!" :) The fact that it''s blurry before and after your critter is disturbing to me, I want to be able to inspect it from this fabulous safe distance, but can''t :(  - A for Creepy/Fear factor C for clarity B for creativity. Good job all around. 7 cthenk</td>', 'Oh my god I bet you are getting a lot of "YUCKS!!" :) The fact that it''s blurry before and after your critter is disturbing to me, I want to be able to inspect it from this fabulous safe distance, but can''t :(  - A for Creepy/Fear factor C for clarity B for creativity. Good job all around. 7 cthenk', '2002-07-12 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
