(82093, 3043, 472, '<td valign="top">i bet you got this head  in a voodoo shop in new orleans.  this could be a good shot but i dont think that the illumination is particularly interesting or flattering.  looks like straight on camera flash, which is rarely appealing.  try some different lighting.   mag 99</td>', 'i bet you got this head  in a voodoo shop in new orleans.  this could be a good shot but i dont think that the illumination is particularly interesting or flattering.  looks like straight on camera flash, which is rarely appealing.  try some different lighting.   mag 99', '2002-07-11 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82094, 3043, 828, '<td valign="top">I think I recognize those toes..........</td>', 'I think I recognize those toes..........', '2002-07-11 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82095, 3043, 1054, '<td valign="top">Very well done, and believable.</td>', 'Very well done, and believable.', '2002-07-12 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82096, 3043, 2686, '<td valign="top">oh my!  i hope that is not a REAL one!</td>', 'oh my!  i hope that is not a REAL one!', '2002-07-12 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82097, 3043, 2437, '<td valign="top">you should have used a little lighting on the back</td>', 'you should have used a little lighting on the back', '2002-07-13 06:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82098, 3043, 1169, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2002-07-14 01:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82099, 3043, 436, '<td valign="top">I tried lighting this from behind more, but the edges of the preserved gator head showed.  I''d appreciate any other lighting tips I can get!  The head was massaged with vaseline to get an "alive" sheen.  The head came from a shop in the keys.  The foot belongs to my son.  If you are considering blood:  red food coloring in corn syrup looks more realistic than ketchup.</td>', 'I tried lighting this from behind more, but the edges of the preserved gator head showed.  I''d appreciate any other lighting tips I can get!  The head was massaged with vaseline to get an "alive" sheen.  The head came from a shop in the keys.  The foot belongs to my son.  If you are considering blood:  red food coloring in corn syrup looks more realistic than ketchup.', '2002-07-15 09:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(82100, 3044, 772, '<td valign="top">I definitely do understand the ''fear'' of a heart attack.  I just wish the photo relayed more fear to me.  The Garfield doll and the heart pillow seem to be more comforting than any element of fear in the image... = 5 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I definitely do understand the ''fear'' of a heart attack.  I just wish the photo relayed more fear to me.  The Garfield doll and the heart pillow seem to be more comforting than any element of fear in the image... = 5 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-08 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82101, 3044, 1005, '<td valign="top">Seems more good, than scary.  Well taken photo.  7 Swash</td>', 'Seems more good, than scary.  Well taken photo.  7 Swash', '2002-07-08 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82102, 3044, 2152, '<td valign="top">Would be more effective if someone was really using the defib.</td>', 'Would be more effective if someone was really using the defib.', '2002-07-08 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82103, 3044, 1944, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. At my age, I''m getting more into this type of fear:) One thing: I don''t understand the reason for the heart and the Garfield. Maybe if I was an EMT I''d understand more. Nice job though. Shey.</td>', 'Nice photo. At my age, I''m getting more into this type of fear:) One thing: I don''t understand the reason for the heart and the Garfield. Maybe if I was an EMT I''d understand more. Nice job though. Shey.', '2002-07-08 20:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82104, 3044, 811, '<td valign="top">Is Garfield a commentary for all of us who eat unhealthily? :-)  Interesting composition, I think an upward angle might have given a more impending feeling.  Then, the cart would have seemed bigger and more looming.  Your angle gives the feeling that I am looking down on it, and thus have control over the situation.  Of course, I understand you can''t just go around in a hospital (?) taking pictures whereever you like.  karmat<br/>PS -- Was it supposed to be "Heat Attack" or did you mean "Heart Attack"</td>', 'Is Garfield a commentary for all of us who eat unhealthily? :-)  Interesting composition, I think an upward angle might have given a more impending feeling.  Then, the cart would have seemed bigger and more looming.  Your angle gives the feeling that I am looking down on it, and thus have control over the situation.  Of course, I understand you can''t just go around in a hospital (?) taking pictures whereever you like.  karmatPS -- Was it supposed to be "Heat Attack" or did you mean "Heart Attack"', '2002-07-10 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82105, 3044, 2641, '<td valign="top">nice tool chest but i dont see fear</td>', 'nice tool chest but i dont see fear', '2002-07-10 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
