(82148, 3048, 1005, '<td valign="top">Did the wax come out of the keyboard?  Nasty!  If I say the candle light is too bright, then I condem your keyboard to black, if I say your keyboard is too dark, your candle light will be even more blown out.  Bottom line:  this shot as set up is outside the range of most any camera.  5 Swash</td>', 'Did the wax come out of the keyboard?  Nasty!  If I say the candle light is too bright, then I condem your keyboard to black, if I say your keyboard is too dark, your candle light will be even more blown out.  Bottom line:  this shot as set up is outside the range of most any camera.  5 Swash', '2002-07-09 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
