(82158, 3048, 472, '<td valign="top">very creative. i guess that computer isnt going to be working, is it.  about the only thing i would suggest is that if you have spot metering, meter for the candle flame itself - then you will get a clearer flame instead of the over-exposure.  the rest of the pic will be darker, but i think that would be better.  also it''s seems a little tilted to left.  mag 99.</td>', 'very creative. i guess that computer isnt going to be working, is it.  about the only thing i would suggest is that if you have spot metering, meter for the candle flame itself - then you will get a clearer flame instead of the over-exposure.  the rest of the pic will be darker, but i think that would be better.  also it''s seems a little tilted to left.  mag 99.', '2002-07-11 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
