(82180, 3049, 1856, '<td valign="top">I like the picture quality and the idea...but I''ve never been given an exam where I could have all my books out, a nice hot cup of coffee and an apple to munch.   Where do you go to school?  Also, I think the exam should be able to be identified without having to cozy up to the screen and squint...either by making it more easily legible or by making the context of the photo seem more like there''s an exam going on.  6 Lisa</td>', 'I like the picture quality and the idea...but I''ve never been given an exam where I could have all my books out, a nice hot cup of coffee and an apple to munch.   Where do you go to school?  Also, I think the exam should be able to be identified without having to cozy up to the screen and squint...either by making it more easily legible or by making the context of the photo seem more like there''s an exam going on.  6 Lisa', '2002-07-09 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
