(82197, 3049, 527, '<td valign="top">Great idea but I am m;uch more afraid of tests when I have no materials around me to study from. For me seeing a test paper and a timer would instill the most fear in me.<br/><br/>6  -Tim</td>', 'Great idea but I am m;uch more afraid of tests when I have no materials around me to study from. For me seeing a test paper and a timer would instill the most fear in me.6  -Tim', '2002-07-13 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
