(82260, 3053, 1005, '<td valign="top">O.K., I fear them too.  (call me tuna!)  Very good shot.   I have tried these through glass underwater shots often, this is about as good as it gets.  (that was supposed to sound so much more positive.)  8 Swash</td>', 'O.K., I fear them too.  (call me tuna!)  Very good shot.   I have tried these through glass underwater shots often, this is about as good as it gets.  (that was supposed to sound so much more positive.)  8 Swash', '2002-07-10 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
