(82262, 3053, 2672, '<td valign="top">your mum says I have to do this or she won''t leave me alone! It is good however, when I try to take pictures of fish, I find that they tend to blur on my digital camera.....;-) Dan</td>', 'your mum says I have to do this or she won''t leave me alone! It is good however, when I try to take pictures of fish, I find that they tend to blur on my digital camera.....;-) Dan', '2002-07-11 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
