(82272, 3055, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice : )</td>', 'nice : )', '2002-07-08 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82273, 3055, 92, '<td valign="top">This is a GREAT photo ! It''s really got nice DOF and color ect. The FEAR just isn''t there for me.</td>', 'This is a GREAT photo ! It''s really got nice DOF and color ect. The FEAR just isn''t there for me.', '2002-07-08 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82274, 3055, 2380, '<td valign="top">Good photo... but more of despair rather than fear</td>', 'Good photo... but more of despair rather than fear', '2002-07-09 04:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82275, 3055, 2261, '<td valign="top">Horrible and very effective.</td>', 'Horrible and very effective.', '2002-07-09 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82276, 3055, 990, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  You received the only top mark I gave out.  In my opinion, many photos did not embody the premise of FEAR.  Your idea was brilliant!</td>', 'Excellent.  You received the only top mark I gave out.  In my opinion, many photos did not embody the premise of FEAR.  Your idea was brilliant!', '2002-07-09 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82277, 3055, 641, '<td valign="top">Great color and detail. I also love the composition of this!</td>', 'Great color and detail. I also love the composition of this!', '2002-07-10 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82278, 3055, 885, '<td valign="top">I like the out of focus background, but I think maybe your whole fly isn''t quite in focus.  Some may complain about that bright spot to the right, but I sort of like it for balance.  Nice composition.</td>', 'I like the out of focus background, but I think maybe your whole fly isn''t quite in focus.  Some may complain about that bright spot to the right, but I sort of like it for balance.  Nice composition.', '2002-07-10 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82279, 3055, 772, '<td valign="top">i like this photo :)  a little more depth of field and it would be really great! = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'i like this photo :)  a little more depth of field and it would be really great! = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-10 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82280, 3055, 1564, '<td valign="top">Good Picture.  Did you rescue it after you took a picture of it?</td>', 'Good Picture.  Did you rescue it after you took a picture of it?', '2002-07-10 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82281, 3055, 2647, '<td valign="top">the imphsis on the strugles between life and death  good image</td>', 'the imphsis on the strugles between life and death  good image', '2002-07-10 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82282, 3055, 671, '<td valign="top">subject 6 composition 7 lighting 7 focus 5 total 6</td>', 'subject 6 composition 7 lighting 7 focus 5 total 6', '2002-07-10 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82283, 3055, 2641, '<td valign="top">interesting picture but i dont see fear</td>', 'interesting picture but i dont see fear', '2002-07-10 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82284, 3055, 1005, '<td valign="top">I think that''s a horse fly, couldn''t have happened to a better fly.  Very good shot of the lower half of the fly, but the upper half (head, etc) isn''t focused.  Broaden your depth of field and get the whole guy.  8 Swash</td>', 'I think that''s a horse fly, couldn''t have happened to a better fly.  Very good shot of the lower half of the fly, but the upper half (head, etc) isn''t focused.  Broaden your depth of field and get the whole guy.  8 Swash', '2002-07-10 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82285, 3055, 1202, '<td valign="top">It is just too bad the rascal couldn''t have been flapping those wings about a houndred miles an hour.   Then you would have had real fear.   Macros sure are hard to get in total  focus on a three dimensional subject, aren''t they.   That would have helped considerably.   The bright spot on the right is quite distracting and may have caused some of your difficulty.   A 6 by Autool</td>', 'It is just too bad the rascal couldn''t have been flapping those wings about a houndred miles an hour.   Then you would have had real fear.   Macros sure are hard to get in total  focus on a three dimensional subject, aren''t they.   That would have helped considerably.   The bright spot on the right is quite distracting and may have caused some of your difficulty.   A 6 by Autool', '2002-07-10 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82286, 3055, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro. I like the thaw drops in the spider net.<br/>I think the photo would look better when the bee (flea?) and the whole spidernet would be in focus. A smaller aperture could have helped to get more DOF. The white spot on the right side distracts from the main object.</td>', 'Very nice macro. I like the thaw drops in the spider net.I think the photo would look better when the bee (flea?) and the whole spidernet would be in focus. A smaller aperture could have helped to get more DOF. The white spot on the right side distracts from the main object.', '2002-07-11 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82287, 3055, 2668, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot, caught something that most people walk past everyday.</td>', 'Nice Shot, caught something that most people walk past everyday.', '2002-07-11 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82288, 3055, 509, '<td valign="top">If I were him, I''d be pretty scared, nice macro!  I like the light reflections here.</td>', 'If I were him, I''d be pretty scared, nice macro!  I like the light reflections here.', '2002-07-11 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82289, 3055, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good photo, I''m sure some people will miss that it is the bee feeling fear.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Good photo, I''m sure some people will miss that it is the bee feeling fear.  Nicely done.', '2002-07-12 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82290, 3055, 878, '<td valign="top">Soon to be food</td>', 'Soon to be food', '2002-07-12 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82291, 3055, 2661, '<td valign="top">Very nice subject choice and a good use of pull focus. The insect''s head could stand to be a little more in focus, but I really like the picture.</td>', 'Very nice subject choice and a good use of pull focus. The insect''s head could stand to be a little more in focus, but I really like the picture.', '2002-07-12 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
