(82407, 3062, 1005, '<td valign="top">She can''t be that bad! (Joke)  Don''t like the motion, takes too much away from the face trying to look scared  (blair witchy thing).  6 Swash</td>', 'She can''t be that bad! (Joke)  Don''t like the motion, takes too much away from the face trying to look scared  (blair witchy thing).  6 Swash', '2002-07-08 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
