(82420, 3062, 255, '<td valign="top">man what a freaky picture, i could absolutely not have it hanging in my house, it would for sure give me nightmares! But I love it anyway, nicely done. 10-amitchell</td>', 'man what a freaky picture, i could absolutely not have it hanging in my house, it would for sure give me nightmares! But I love it anyway, nicely done. 10-amitchell', '2002-07-13 04:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
