(82440, 3063, 2302, '<td valign="top">meeting challenge = 5 (I don''t mind spiders but I wouldn''t want to run into this guy anywhere) photo quality = 3 seems a bit blury and out of focus. total = 8</td>', 'meeting challenge = 5 (I don''t mind spiders but I wouldn''t want to run into this guy anywhere) photo quality = 3 seems a bit blury and out of focus. total = 8', '2002-07-09 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82441, 3063, 772, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better spider shots in this challenge.  I like the head on view so you can see his beady little eyes :)  The shot looks a little grainy... I also have a minor problem with the crop.  I would have either tried to get closer to the main body of the spider or I would have tried to include the whole spider.  Some of the legs being cropped out without all of them being cropped puzzles me a little :) Good shot! = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is one of the better spider shots in this challenge.  I like the head on view so you can see his beady little eyes :)  The shot looks a little grainy... I also have a minor problem with the crop.  I would have either tried to get closer to the main body of the spider or I would have tried to include the whole spider.  Some of the legs being cropped out without all of them being cropped puzzles me a little :) Good shot! = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-09 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
