(82446, 3063, 509, '<td valign="top">Good shot!  I just wish there was less noise in the photo.  I''m guessing you had to use a high ISO to get a good enough shutter speed, but a despeckle filter in photoshop or equivalent might help a bit.</td>', 'Good shot!  I just wish there was less noise in the photo.  I''m guessing you had to use a high ISO to get a good enough shutter speed, but a despeckle filter in photoshop or equivalent might help a bit.', '2002-07-10 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
