(82448, 3063, 811, '<td valign="top">YEECCCKKK, I normally don''t mind spiders, but then again, I normally am not looking at them eye-to-eye, either.  If possible, a sharper focus might have helped ''cause it looks a little fuzzy (the focus, not the spider) to me.  Of course, that might have meant you needed to get closer, and I can understand why you didn''t.  karmat</td>', 'YEECCCKKK, I normally don''t mind spiders, but then again, I normally am not looking at them eye-to-eye, either.  If possible, a sharper focus might have helped ''cause it looks a little fuzzy (the focus, not the spider) to me.  Of course, that might have meant you needed to get closer, and I can understand why you didn''t.  karmat', '2002-07-10 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82449, 3063, 1313, '<td valign="top">Yuck, that''s scary.  It would have been a great shot if it was crawling up someone who looked terrified.  By itself it does not really show fear but still kind of cool so I won''t score you low.</td>', 'Yuck, that''s scary.  It would have been a great shot if it was crawling up someone who looked terrified.  By itself it does not really show fear but still kind of cool so I won''t score you low.', '2002-07-10 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82450, 3063, 1005, '<td valign="top">Grainy!  Sorry if you have a low end camera.  Start with more light.  Next, don''t crop off his poor legs, he only has eight of them.  A stronger contrasting background would not hurt either.  6 Swash</td>', 'Grainy!  Sorry if you have a low end camera.  Start with more light.  Next, don''t crop off his poor legs, he only has eight of them.  A stronger contrasting background would not hurt either.  6 Swash', '2002-07-10 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82451, 3063, 1202, '<td valign="top">To see one of these would probably scare the majority of us, but your picture seems to make him out to be a nice guy with a smile on his face.   What is that extra body part in the upper right of the photo?   I would have like to see a clearer shot, and  you lost some composition when you tried to make him look bigger and chopped off his legs.   a 4 by Autool</td>', 'To see one of these would probably scare the majority of us, but your picture seems to make him out to be a nice guy with a smile on his face.   What is that extra body part in the upper right of the photo?   I would have like to see a clearer shot, and  you lost some composition when you tried to make him look bigger and chopped off his legs.   a 4 by Autool', '2002-07-10 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82452, 3063, 806, '<td valign="top">OMG! It actually looks like it has a face of a bearded man! - Almost devilish! There''s a weird quality to the lighting. Over brightened?</td>', 'OMG! It actually looks like it has a face of a bearded man! - Almost devilish! There''s a weird quality to the lighting. Over brightened?', '2002-07-10 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82453, 3063, 917, '<td valign="top">Im seeing red and green areas all over this picture, possibly because youve zoomed in on a small part of the original picture. Good depth of focus.</td>', 'Im seeing red and green areas all over this picture, possibly because youve zoomed in on a small part of the original picture. Good depth of focus.', '2002-07-11 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
