(82468, 3063, 1078, '<td valign="top">I think in terms of composition, this is one of the best spider shots this week.  Looks like it may have been shot with a flash which kind of blows out the contrast.  Also looks like you either have a lower end camera or you had to blow this up significantly for it to fill the frame -- it''s very grainy and so you lose a lot of the fine detail.</td>', 'I think in terms of composition, this is one of the best spider shots this week.  Looks like it may have been shot with a flash which kind of blows out the contrast.  Also looks like you either have a lower end camera or you had to blow this up significantly for it to fill the frame -- it''s very grainy and so you lose a lot of the fine detail.', '2002-07-15 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82469, 3064, 92, '<td valign="top">Overall, I like this pic a lot. There is a tat too much sky so maybe a different crop. The thing that I''m having issues with is....the title saves it. Without the title I would see no fear.</td>', 'Overall, I like this pic a lot. There is a tat too much sky so maybe a different crop. The thing that I''m having issues with is....the title saves it. Without the title I would see no fear.', '2002-07-08 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
