(82486, 3064, 2642, '<td valign="top">Interesting</td>', 'Interesting', '2002-07-10 02:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82487, 3064, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple composition.  I was actually looking for barbed wire for my shot, but couldn''t find any...so of course I like your idea.</td>', 'Nice, simple composition.  I was actually looking for barbed wire for my shot, but couldn''t find any...so of course I like your idea.', '2002-07-10 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82488, 3064, 2641, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture but i dont see fear</td>', 'beautiful picture but i dont see fear', '2002-07-10 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82489, 3064, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple execution, it''s a good idea, but needs the title to "rescue it".  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice, simple execution, it''s a good idea, but needs the title to "rescue it".  7 Swash', '2002-07-10 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82490, 3064, 308, '<td valign="top">Very simple, yet it speaks so much.  The sky looks incredible.  Great work.</td>', 'Very simple, yet it speaks so much.  The sky looks incredible.  Great work.', '2002-07-10 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82491, 3064, 1, '<td valign="top">pretty damned awesome photo, but it doesn''t exactly represent fear.</td>', 'pretty damned awesome photo, but it doesn''t exactly represent fear.', '2002-07-11 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82492, 3064, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice shot.. simplicity always works for me.  The single strand of barbed wire silhouetted against the sky offers a nice contrast, not only in the image, but a contrast between freedom and captivity :)  = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'very nice shot.. simplicity always works for me.  The single strand of barbed wire silhouetted against the sky offers a nice contrast, not only in the image, but a contrast between freedom and captivity :)  = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-11 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82493, 3064, 472, '<td valign="top">good image.  well shot. clean.  i took an image similar to this : ) ..  no real suggestions for improvement.  i think this could make a poster for amnesty international : ) .. mag 99.</td>', 'good image.  well shot. clean.  i took an image similar to this : ) ..  no real suggestions for improvement.  i think this could make a poster for amnesty international : ) .. mag 99.', '2002-07-11 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82494, 3064, 2686, '<td valign="top">simple, yet fits the challenge.  Fear of imprisonment.  Good thinking.</td>', 'simple, yet fits the challenge.  Fear of imprisonment.  Good thinking.', '2002-07-12 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82495, 3064, 2696, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective.</td>', 'Simple and effective.', '2002-07-12 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82496, 3064, 255, '<td valign="top">nice and simple--i like this. 8-amitchell</td>', 'nice and simple--i like this. 8-amitchell', '2002-07-13 04:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82497, 3064, 2261, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.</td>', 'Nice picture.', '2002-07-13 06:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82498, 3064, 2700, '<td valign="top">great shot, just dont see fear</td>', 'great shot, just dont see fear', '2002-07-13 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82499, 3064, 2481, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept - needs more "meat" - nice shot of sky. Good color.  Might have used multiple shots of the wire in a more effective design</td>', 'Interesting concept - needs more "meat" - nice shot of sky. Good color.  Might have used multiple shots of the wire in a more effective design', '2002-07-13 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82500, 3064, 1379, '<td valign="top">What a great ad this would be for Amnesty International.  I love it.</td>', 'What a great ad this would be for Amnesty International.  I love it.', '2002-07-13 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82501, 3064, 1323, '<td valign="top">very pretty blue sky, one of my favorites this week</td>', 'very pretty blue sky, one of my favorites this week', '2002-07-14 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82502, 3064, 2, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, though the darkness on the left side bothers me a little.</td>', 'I really like this shot, though the darkness on the left side bothers me a little.', '2002-07-14 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82503, 3064, 1078, '<td valign="top">Very simple and very effective.  I have a similar shot, but it used a strange pinwheeling metal wall emplacement to keep people out of a backyard (and probably pigeons off the wall).  You''ve got some problems with the clouds -- those on the right are blown out while those on the left are gray and kind of murky.  I think I would have tried to keep more texture in the ones on the right.  I''d suggest (even tho I like the color) seeing what this one looks like in B&amp;W as well.  Make it a little more stark.  Good work.</td>', 'Very simple and very effective.  I have a similar shot, but it used a strange pinwheeling metal wall emplacement to keep people out of a backyard (and probably pigeons off the wall).  You''ve got some problems with the clouds -- those on the right are blown out while those on the left are gray and kind of murky.  I think I would have tried to keep more texture in the ones on the right.  I''d suggest (even tho I like the color) seeing what this one looks like in B&W as well.  Make it a little more stark.  Good work.', '2002-07-14 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82504, 3064, 2065, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2002-07-14 19:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82505, 3064, 2719, '<td valign="top">Great sillohuette, color/composition.</td>', 'Great sillohuette, color/composition.', '2002-07-14 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82506, 3064, 656, '<td valign="top">Rough score - this was easily my favourite this time around...  Good placing though.</td>', 'Rough score - this was easily my favourite this time around...  Good placing though.', '2002-07-15 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(82507, 3065, 92, '<td valign="top">A little over exposed. I don''t see fear.</td>', 'A little over exposed. I don''t see fear.', '2002-07-08 03:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82508, 3065, 789, '<td valign="top">if the bird wsa in focus it would be an amazing photo.</td>', 'if the bird wsa in focus it would be an amazing photo.', '2002-07-08 07:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82509, 3065, 1779, '<td valign="top">cool!  : ) shame it''s oout of focus...</td>', 'cool!  : ) shame it''s oout of focus...', '2002-07-08 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82510, 3065, 2373, '<td valign="top">This would be cool if the birds were a little more in focus</td>', 'This would be cool if the birds were a little more in focus', '2002-07-08 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82511, 3065, 2134, '<td valign="top">would have liked the subject to be in focus...4</td>', 'would have liked the subject to be in focus...4', '2002-07-08 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82512, 3065, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot.. .did u scare the birds? lol... This is a particularly difficult shot to pull off.  The bird in the foreground would be my choice of sharp focus in this photo.  I''m sure this photo happened rather quickly however.  In order to correct this, you would need manual focus capability to preset the focus before the shot, or you would need depth of field settings deep enough to focus everything in the frame...  = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a cool shot.. .did u scare the birds? lol... This is a particularly difficult shot to pull off.  The bird in the foreground would be my choice of sharp focus in this photo.  I''m sure this photo happened rather quickly however.  In order to correct this, you would need manual focus capability to preset the focus before the shot, or you would need depth of field settings deep enough to focus everything in the frame...  = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-08 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82513, 3065, 2152, '<td valign="top">The blur on the birds doesn''t really work on this shot.  I''m drawn more to the pole and the background than the birds.  I''m also having a hard time trying to figure out where the fear is.</td>', 'The blur on the birds doesn''t really work on this shot.  I''m drawn more to the pole and the background than the birds.  I''m also having a hard time trying to figure out where the fear is.', '2002-07-08 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82514, 3065, 1005, '<td valign="top">Background well focused.  Bird fear, it will be "reaching" for most viewers.  Try switching to manual focus, if your cam supports it (and doesn''t error like mine).  I wish I could give you a better score.......4 Swash</td>', 'Background well focused.  Bird fear, it will be "reaching" for most viewers.  Try switching to manual focus, if your cam supports it (and doesn''t error like mine).  I wish I could give you a better score.......4 Swash', '2002-07-08 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82515, 3065, 2146, '<td valign="top">set shutter speed would hav been a nice picture</td>', 'set shutter speed would hav been a nice picture', '2002-07-08 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82516, 3065, 2337, '<td valign="top">Focus problems here.  And I don''t quite get the relationship to fear.  Is the bird afraid? If so I don''t see it here.</td>', 'Focus problems here.  And I don''t quite get the relationship to fear.  Is the bird afraid? If so I don''t see it here.', '2002-07-09 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82517, 3065, 2380, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2002-07-09 04:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82518, 3065, 2221, '<td valign="top">nice idea of showing an animals natural fear of humans (or other animals).<br/>i don''t know but maybe decided to leave the focus on the background so that the motion of the bird "fleeing" is captured. but actually i think the other way around would have looked better. the bid in focus and the background blurred. the bird is your primary object so it should be in focus.<br/>also the lawn is much brighter than the bird which distracts from the bird, too.<br/>the other bird in the background is distracting but that''s how wildlife shots are. you can''t set them up for posing perfectly ;-)</td>', 'nice idea of showing an animals natural fear of humans (or other animals).i don''t know but maybe decided to leave the focus on the background so that the motion of the bird "fleeing" is captured. but actually i think the other way around would have looked better. the bid in focus and the background blurred. the bird is your primary object so it should be in focus.also the lawn is much brighter than the bird which distracts from the bird, too.the other bird in the background is distracting but that''s how wildlife shots are. you can''t set them up for posing perfectly ;-)', '2002-07-09 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82519, 3065, 1041, '<td valign="top">i think this would be a lot better if the focus was on the birds and not the trees in the background.  i like the motion blur on the left bird.  i know the focus is tough to achieve with moving subjects like that.  manually focusing (if your camera allows that) is one option, or focusing on something that is the appropriate distance away and pressing the shutterbutton half way down to lock focus, then move the camera and take the picture is another option. -- gr8photos (2)</td>', 'i think this would be a lot better if the focus was on the birds and not the trees in the background.  i like the motion blur on the left bird.  i know the focus is tough to achieve with moving subjects like that.  manually focusing (if your camera allows that) is one option, or focusing on something that is the appropriate distance away and pressing the shutterbutton half way down to lock focus, then move the camera and take the picture is another option. -- gr8photos (2)', '2002-07-09 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82520, 3065, 472, '<td valign="top">nice catch. 2 at once!  there''s something thought that doesnt really hold my attentnion here. maybe its because im not really sure why the birds are scared.</td>', 'nice catch. 2 at once!  there''s something thought that doesnt really hold my attentnion here. maybe its because im not really sure why the birds are scared.', '2002-07-09 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82521, 3065, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture, but shame on you for scaring the poor birds trying to eat! :-)  I like the way everything is in focus except the birds -- it gives a sense of motion.  My only critical comment would be that it needs some "color" in the picture.  The greens are nice, but it is all kinda camo-ed.  Too bad you didn''t have a male cardinal taking off.  karmat</td>', 'Good capture, but shame on you for scaring the poor birds trying to eat! :-)  I like the way everything is in focus except the birds -- it gives a sense of motion.  My only critical comment would be that it needs some "color" in the picture.  The greens are nice, but it is all kinda camo-ed.  Too bad you didn''t have a male cardinal taking off.  karmat', '2002-07-10 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82522, 3065, 2641, '<td valign="top">beautifl picture but i dont see fear, maybe if the challengewas  in motion i''d give it a 10. but i''ll still give it a 7</td>', 'beautifl picture but i dont see fear, maybe if the challengewas  in motion i''d give it a 10. but i''ll still give it a 7', '2002-07-10 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82523, 3065, 573, '<td valign="top">I see some motion blur in both of the birds, if stop motion was your objective and you are using your camera''s shortest shutter speed then you need to go to an electronic flash.  The more powerfull ones will stop motion in open shade and even daylight.  BTW I am having trouble making the connection to whis weeks challenge, sorry.</td>', 'I see some motion blur in both of the birds, if stop motion was your objective and you are using your camera''s shortest shutter speed then you need to go to an electronic flash.  The more powerfull ones will stop motion in open shade and even daylight.  BTW I am having trouble making the connection to whis weeks challenge, sorry.', '2002-07-10 23:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82524, 3065, 2466, '<td valign="top">good catch!  Did they really sit on the stick?</td>', 'good catch!  Did they really sit on the stick?', '2002-07-12 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82525, 3065, 2261, '<td valign="top">Shame the birds are ot of focus, otherwise this would have been great.</td>', 'Shame the birds are ot of focus, otherwise this would have been great.', '2002-07-13 06:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82526, 3065, 661, '<td valign="top">Too bad it''s not more clear.</td>', 'Too bad it''s not more clear.', '2002-07-13 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
