(82534, 3067, 811, '<td valign="top">Good use of shadow.  I also like the way it is composed and shot.  One minor nit-picky thing, her body looks relaxed.   Unfourtunately, I have no idea how to tell you to correct that, it was just an observation.</td>', 'Good use of shadow.  I also like the way it is composed and shot.  One minor nit-picky thing, her body looks relaxed.   Unfourtunately, I have no idea how to tell you to correct that, it was just an observation.', '2002-07-09 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82535, 3067, 2380, '<td valign="top">Nice concept........ very nice concept but not shot very well...toomuch light and visibility of ambience to instigate fear</td>', 'Nice concept........ very nice concept but not shot very well...toomuch light and visibility of ambience to instigate fear', '2002-07-09 04:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82536, 3067, 472, '<td valign="top">i almost did this one :) . i would suggest more dramatic lighting (ie one sidelight) and maybe black and white.  mag 99</td>', 'i almost did this one :) . i would suggest more dramatic lighting (ie one sidelight) and maybe black and white.  mag 99', '2002-07-09 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
