(82539, 3067, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept :)  It didn''t turn out to be cliche after all :) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'Interesting concept :)  It didn''t turn out to be cliche after all :) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-10 07:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
