(82545, 3067, 2700, '<td valign="top">awsome... looks like you got 1 up on the other shawdow picuture...</td>', 'awsome... looks like you got 1 up on the other shawdow picuture...', '2002-07-13 02:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82546, 3067, 2481, '<td valign="top">nice play on shadows.</td>', 'nice play on shadows.', '2002-07-13 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82547, 3067, 2661, '<td valign="top">I like the idea a lot. Also well executed.</td>', 'I like the idea a lot. Also well executed.', '2002-07-13 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82548, 3067, 2061, '<td valign="top">At least the title tells it like it is :-)</td>', 'At least the title tells it like it is :-)', '2002-07-14 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82549, 3067, 2065, '<td valign="top">scary!!!</td>', 'scary!!!', '2002-07-14 19:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82550, 3067, 2, '<td valign="top">At least your cliche was well-executed.  Very nice framing and clean, sharp shadows.</td>', 'At least your cliche was well-executed.  Very nice framing and clean, sharp shadows.', '2002-07-14 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82551, 3067, 1078, '<td valign="top">It wasn''t too cliche.  I''m trying to figure out how you might spice it up a little bit.  First, I think I''d try to shoot somewhere or move your light source so that the only shadow on the wall is the kinfe and hand -- especially since they were apparently different distances from the light and one is darker than the other.  Initially the girls pose seemed very real, but the longer I looked at it, the more it seemed like she''s just sitting there -- it has something to do with the hand (it looks like it''s just kind of draped over her head).  Still, nice work.</td>', 'It wasn''t too cliche.  I''m trying to figure out how you might spice it up a little bit.  First, I think I''d try to shoot somewhere or move your light source so that the only shadow on the wall is the kinfe and hand -- especially since they were apparently different distances from the light and one is darker than the other.  Initially the girls pose seemed very real, but the longer I looked at it, the more it seemed like she''s just sitting there -- it has something to do with the hand (it looks like it''s just kind of draped over her head).  Still, nice work.', '2002-07-15 00:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82565, 3069, 92, '<td valign="top">WOW @ the clarity ! VERY nice detail. I feel the fear for sure !</td>', 'WOW @ the clarity ! VERY nice detail. I feel the fear for sure !', '2002-07-08 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82566, 3069, 917, '<td valign="top">Not sure you''ve got your rule of thirds right.</td>', 'Not sure you''ve got your rule of thirds right.', '2002-07-08 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82567, 3069, 1779, '<td valign="top">cool!  : )</td>', 'cool!  : )', '2002-07-08 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82568, 3069, 1569, '<td valign="top">I t looks like the left needs a tighter crop,otherwise great pix.</td>', 'I t looks like the left needs a tighter crop,otherwise great pix.', '2002-07-08 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82569, 3069, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very scary subject.  The wasps around here build more tan colored nests, I think their wings are clear and possibly a different color pattern.  I try not to get this close.  Thank you for the wonderful shot!  Personally, I would have cropped this for portrait (wiped out the left, blank side).   9 Swash</td>', 'Very scary subject.  The wasps around here build more tan colored nests, I think their wings are clear and possibly a different color pattern.  I try not to get this close.  Thank you for the wonderful shot!  Personally, I would have cropped this for portrait (wiped out the left, blank side).   9 Swash', '2002-07-08 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82570, 3069, 2373, '<td valign="top">nice macro</td>', 'nice macro', '2002-07-08 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82571, 3069, 2610, '<td valign="top">I hate these things too!  You get points for getting this close.</td>', 'I hate these things too!  You get points for getting this close.', '2002-07-08 23:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82572, 3069, 1042, '<td valign="top">closer than I ever wanna get. :)<br/>great job 9</td>', 'closer than I ever wanna get. :)great job 9', '2002-07-09 00:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82573, 3069, 2123, '<td valign="top">Well, they''re MY worst fear, anyway. :-)  The evil little bugger is nicely shot</td>', 'Well, they''re MY worst fear, anyway. :-)  The evil little bugger is nicely shot', '2002-07-09 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82574, 3069, 1, '<td valign="top">The upsidedownness of it all doesn''t work for me.  Great detail though.</td>', 'The upsidedownness of it all doesn''t work for me.  Great detail though.', '2002-07-09 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82575, 3069, 2274, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.</td>', 'Nice macro.', '2002-07-09 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82576, 3069, 1944, '<td valign="top">Finally, a micro shot that has the proper DOF! Good capture and good theme. Reminds me of the time a neighbor and I tried to get rid of a large hornet''s nest under his eave. Not a good memory either:)</td>', 'Finally, a micro shot that has the proper DOF! Good capture and good theme. Reminds me of the time a neighbor and I tried to get rid of a large hornet''s nest under his eave. Not a good memory either:)', '2002-07-09 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82577, 3069, 2638, '<td valign="top">good picture</td>', 'good picture', '2002-07-09 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82578, 3069, 772, '<td valign="top">I love the angle and the clarity on this shot... good work! = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I love the angle and the clarity on this shot... good work! = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-09 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82579, 3069, 671, '<td valign="top">subject 10 composition 7 focus 7 lighting 7 total 8</td>', 'subject 10 composition 7 focus 7 lighting 7 total 8', '2002-07-10 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82580, 3069, 811, '<td valign="top">Actually, it''s a little too close for me!!!  I hate these things; their nests are kinda cool though.  good focus and depth.  I think it might have been better if it wasn''t cropped quite so closely to the bee with all the open space in the left.  In other words, move the bee further up and to the left.</td>', 'Actually, it''s a little too close for me!!!  I hate these things; their nests are kinda cool though.  good focus and depth.  I think it might have been better if it wasn''t cropped quite so closely to the bee with all the open space in the left.  In other words, move the bee further up and to the left.', '2002-07-10 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82581, 3069, 2641, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture but i dont see fear</td>', 'beautiful picture but i dont see fear', '2002-07-10 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82582, 3069, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good...very good picture of a wasp.  Doesn''t quite interpret fear in my opinion though.  I do like it though.  The only way I can really vote is how applicable it is.</td>', 'Good...very good picture of a wasp.  Doesn''t quite interpret fear in my opinion though.  I do like it though.  The only way I can really vote is how applicable it is.', '2002-07-10 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
