(82611, 3070, 2172, '<td valign="top">Nice photography.  I like the dof.  I was going to do the same type of photo - just didn''t have time.  Definately staring down the barrel of a gun instills fear.  Just one small thing - As I scrolled down the page and part of the top (just below the scope) is not visible - seems more effective - mostly just the barrel.  I can''t keep my eyes off of it.  But I''m sure it would''ve been hard to crop that way.<br/>EXCELLENT - 10 from me!<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Nice photography.  I like the dof.  I was going to do the same type of photo - just didn''t have time.  Definately staring down the barrel of a gun instills fear.  Just one small thing - As I scrolled down the page and part of the top (just below the scope) is not visible - seems more effective - mostly just the barrel.  I can''t keep my eyes off of it.  But I''m sure it would''ve been hard to crop that way.EXCELLENT - 10 from me!Ruthann', '2002-07-10 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
