(82618, 3070, 554, '<td valign="top">You and I will be thought of as a couple of weirdos . Nice job nutcase! well framed and good focus selection. I think these shots use the 90% out of focus well, your''s much better than mine but I believe mine is more fearsome and "In Your Face" phycho. Voters will either love it or hate it but the anti gun folks will keep the scores too low to be in the top 10%.  I do think we have touched the fear nerve in most people though.  good luck------10<br/><br/></td>', 'You and I will be thought of as a couple of weirdos . Nice job nutcase! well framed and good focus selection. I think these shots use the 90% out of focus well, your''s much better than mine but I believe mine is more fearsome and "In Your Face" phycho. Voters will either love it or hate it but the anti gun folks will keep the scores too low to be in the top 10%.  I do think we have touched the fear nerve in most people though.  good luck------10', '2002-07-12 23:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
