(82636, 3071, 811, '<td valign="top">Now, that''s a mean looking little dude.  In one respect, I like the way you''ve lit it strongly from one side, but in another way, I would have liked it better (I think) if it had been slightly lit from the other side as well.  karmat</td>', 'Now, that''s a mean looking little dude.  In one respect, I like the way you''ve lit it strongly from one side, but in another way, I would have liked it better (I think) if it had been slightly lit from the other side as well.  karmat', '2002-07-10 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82637, 3071, 1005, '<td valign="top">Best of the figurines!  Nice lighting and focus.  Toys don''t scare me, but if they did, this would do it.  Good shot.  I like the absense of background, makes it seem like it''s coming out of nowhere.  8 Swash</td>', 'Best of the figurines!  Nice lighting and focus.  Toys don''t scare me, but if they did, this would do it.  Good shot.  I like the absense of background, makes it seem like it''s coming out of nowhere.  8 Swash', '2002-07-10 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82638, 3071, 772, '<td valign="top">well, this doesn''t even begin to scare me.  I will still be able to sleep tonight even though your demon didn''t brush his teeth.  I would have tried to use some liquid paper or somethin on those chompers before u took this pitcher.  I hope you fed him after he posed for this photo.  He looks like he hasn''t had a decent meal in a few days.  This is borderline cruelty.  I may have to report you for this.  If i had to live with someone who didn''t feed me, i''d probalby be after you with an axe also.  Do they have electricity where u live?  If so, i would have turned the light on so i could see this guy better.  The light may have helped make his teeth look whiter too.  :P  = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'well, this doesn''t even begin to scare me.  I will still be able to sleep tonight even though your demon didn''t brush his teeth.  I would have tried to use some liquid paper or somethin on those chompers before u took this pitcher.  I hope you fed him after he posed for this photo.  He looks like he hasn''t had a decent meal in a few days.  This is borderline cruelty.  I may have to report you for this.  If i had to live with someone who didn''t feed me, i''d probalby be after you with an axe also.  Do they have electricity where u live?  If so, i would have turned the light on so i could see this guy better.  The light may have helped make his teeth look whiter too.  :P  = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-11 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
