(82657, 3072, 811, '<td valign="top">I assume the overexposure is purposeful, and though I would like it to be less so (just so the details on the crabs were a little more distinguishable), it does have an interesting effect.  Almost dream-like or surreal.  I like the shadow created as well. So are you saying that you are scared of crabs, or is one of them you -- metaphorically speaking?  karmat</td>', 'I assume the overexposure is purposeful, and though I would like it to be less so (just so the details on the crabs were a little more distinguishable), it does have an interesting effect.  Almost dream-like or surreal.  I like the shadow created as well. So are you saying that you are scared of crabs, or is one of them you -- metaphorically speaking?  karmat', '2002-07-08 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
