(82679, 3072, 2221, '<td valign="top">very good composition. i like the crabs being off-centered. nice background, too. nothing wich would distract. IMHO also nit overexposured. i like it in this case.</td>', 'very good composition. i like the crabs being off-centered. nice background, too. nothing wich would distract. IMHO also nit overexposured. i like it in this case.', '2002-07-13 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
