(82683, 3072, 1078, '<td valign="top">OK, admittedly I don''t get the fear aspect of the shot -- but it feels like it could work so I''m not going to lower my score for that reason.  What bothers me is how over-exposed this is.  I wouldn''t mind so much if the background stayed the same, but it seems like the crabs and their shadows need to be darker to pull this off.  I like the composition and the negative space.</td>', 'OK, admittedly I don''t get the fear aspect of the shot -- but it feels like it could work so I''m not going to lower my score for that reason.  What bothers me is how over-exposed this is.  I wouldn''t mind so much if the background stayed the same, but it seems like the crabs and their shadows need to be darker to pull this off.  I like the composition and the negative space.', '2002-07-15 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
