(82712, 3074, 1572, '<td valign="top">I''m brand new to the site AND digital photography and wouldn''t have clue one of how to do this, but this was one of my favs.  The screams on the side, the pointy tongue and the light really add to the movement of the site.  I love it!  10  :)</td>', 'I''m brand new to the site AND digital photography and wouldn''t have clue one of how to do this, but this was one of my favs.  The screams on the side, the pointy tongue and the light really add to the movement of the site.  I love it!  10  :)', '2002-07-10 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
