(82731, 3074, 472, '<td valign="top">this is cool. i did some versions like this for my self portrait, but you did it alot more convincingly.  your alternate heads are all convincingly solid looking.  best photo in challenge.</td>', 'this is cool. i did some versions like this for my self portrait, but you did it alot more convincingly.  your alternate heads are all convincingly solid looking.  best photo in challenge.', '2002-07-14 02:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
