(82733, 3074, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice showing!  This was one of my favs this week... good work!</td>', 'very nice showing!  This was one of my favs this week... good work!', '2002-07-15 07:36:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(82734, 3074, 1779, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments (a personal record for me). I''m very pleased with the results of this picture, although I agree with some of you that the center part it''s too bright. I wanted to use something different than a hand light but I needed help (wich I didn''t have) so this was the best I could do.<br/><br/>To the ones who ask how it was done... it''s rather simple really: I exposed in total darkness for 8 seconds with a lantern in my hands, and "burned" each of the faces as fast as I could, while turning arround with the ligh off. At the end only the 3 faces where capture. <br/><br/>I had to shoot like 50 or more times, because it was very hard not moving in the shots. I couldn''t get total still faces but I was lucky I got what I got.<br/><br/>Thanks again and good luck!</td>', 'Thank you all for your comments (a personal record for me). I''m very pleased with the results of this picture, although I agree with some of you that the center part it''s too bright. I wanted to use something different than a hand light but I needed help (wich I didn''t have) so this was the best I could do.To the ones who ask how it was done... it''s rather simple really: I exposed in total darkness for 8 seconds with a lantern in my hands, and "burned" each of the faces as fast as I could, while turning arround with the ligh off. At the end only the 3 faces where capture. I had to shoot like 50 or more times, because it was very hard not moving in the shots. I couldn''t get total still faces but I was lucky I got what I got.Thanks again and good luck!', '2002-07-15 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(82735, 3074, 1569, '<td valign="top">Gongrats on third,great picture.</td>', 'Gongrats on third,great picture.', '2002-07-16 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
