(82782, 3076, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo really makes me think... The perspective on the stone is a little odd since it looks straight on the right and off balance on the left, but I know this is from the camera angle... I think that taking about two steps back and allowing some breathing room for the tombstone in the image would be nice :)  I applaud your respect by not positioning this on the front side of the stone :) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This photo really makes me think... The perspective on the stone is a little odd since it looks straight on the right and off balance on the left, but I know this is from the camera angle... I think that taking about two steps back and allowing some breathing room for the tombstone in the image would be nice :)  I applaud your respect by not positioning this on the front side of the stone :) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-08 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
