(82884, 3081, 885, '<td valign="top">Abstract...not sure if this is handheld fireworks or something entirely different.  But it sure looks neat - off-center framing and the lines/sparks/whatever leading to that sun-ish thing work well.  Yeah yeah, you wouldn''t really think ''fear'' if not for the title, but I''m giving you a good score anyhow.</td>', 'Abstract...not sure if this is handheld fireworks or something entirely different.  But it sure looks neat - off-center framing and the lines/sparks/whatever leading to that sun-ish thing work well.  Yeah yeah, you wouldn''t really think ''fear'' if not for the title, but I''m giving you a good score anyhow.', '2002-07-10 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
