(82914, 3082, 2, '<td valign="top">I really love the feet at the top of the image, but I don''t like the stretched shadow as much.  A horizontal crop of the top part of the image would have scored really well with me.</td>', 'I really love the feet at the top of the image, but I don''t like the stretched shadow as much.  A horizontal crop of the top part of the image would have scored really well with me.', '2002-07-14 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
