(82917, 3083, 368, '<td valign="top">i think this would have been better if you showed more ground ... right now it just looks like a blurred pic - in the rain maybe</td>', 'i think this would have been better if you showed more ground ... right now it just looks like a blurred pic - in the rain maybe', '2002-07-08 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
