(82925, 3083, 1041, '<td valign="top">hmm.  is this fear of falling from the bridge (in which case, i think the viewpoint should be higher up to give that impression) or fear that something will fall off the bridge (in which case, a little less blur would be better IMHO).  for me, this shot needs to point more clearly in a specific direction.  i would''ve also cropped out the lights at the left/top. -- gr8photos (2)</td>', 'hmm.  is this fear of falling from the bridge (in which case, i think the viewpoint should be higher up to give that impression) or fear that something will fall off the bridge (in which case, a little less blur would be better IMHO).  for me, this shot needs to point more clearly in a specific direction.  i would''ve also cropped out the lights at the left/top. -- gr8photos (2)', '2002-07-09 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82926, 3083, 2337, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I voted this shot low.   The flaws I saw are now screaming "I''m here on PURPOSE you idiot!" and I''m listening.  At a raw gut level, I can feel the fear here.</td>', 'At first glance, I voted this shot low.   The flaws I saw are now screaming "I''m here on PURPOSE you idiot!" and I''m listening.  At a raw gut level, I can feel the fear here.', '2002-07-09 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
