(82928, 3083, 811, '<td valign="top">Either is falling, or you just hit a big bump. :-)  Interesting use of blur.  Kinda looks like you were taking the picture during an earthquake. karmat</td>', 'Either is falling, or you just hit a big bump. :-)  Interesting use of blur.  Kinda looks like you were taking the picture during an earthquake. karmat', '2002-07-10 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
