(82936, 3083, 1054, '<td valign="top">Is the idea here to convey a bridge collapsing?  If so, that certainly would be scary.  I wish the title gave me more of a clue so I had a context to examine the shot.</td>', 'Is the idea here to convey a bridge collapsing?  If so, that certainly would be scary.  I wish the title gave me more of a clue so I had a context to examine the shot.', '2002-07-12 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82937, 3083, 878, '<td valign="top">I dont know if I like the cars in this shot.  I do liked the blurred effect and colors.</td>', 'I dont know if I like the cars in this shot.  I do liked the blurred effect and colors.', '2002-07-12 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82938, 3083, 1078, '<td valign="top">Liked the hand held shakey motion blur when it was used with the car crash a few challenges ago -- but it doesn''t work for me here.  Plus when I take your title into account -- well, I thought that London Bridge had been shipped, stone by stone, to somewhere in Arizona but the license plates are European...  But that''s just me being nit-picky -- not making me alter my score :-)</td>', 'Liked the hand held shakey motion blur when it was used with the car crash a few challenges ago -- but it doesn''t work for me here.  Plus when I take your title into account -- well, I thought that London Bridge had been shipped, stone by stone, to somewhere in Arizona but the license plates are European...  But that''s just me being nit-picky -- not making me alter my score :-)', '2002-07-14 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82939, 3083, 2719, '<td valign="top">and the cars ar thumping.  is this subwoofer shake?  Cool photo.</td>', 'and the cars ar thumping.  is this subwoofer shake?  Cool photo.', '2002-07-14 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82940, 3084, 92, '<td valign="top">This is more of a snapshot with the cropped off people on each side and not sure I understand what it means. I do understand the title.</td>', 'This is more of a snapshot with the cropped off people on each side and not sure I understand what it means. I do understand the title.', '2002-07-08 02:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82941, 3084, 327, '<td valign="top">You just took this-this week? Wow timely shot here and very nice. Super colors. Kee</td>', 'You just took this-this week? Wow timely shot here and very nice. Super colors. Kee', '2002-07-08 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82942, 3084, 2343, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it, I do but I don''t.  I see happy people hanging out on a viewpoint.  Is this a fear of heights?  I would crop down to remove the overexposed sky and crop from the right to remove what I think is hair or a thumb?  How about seeing what is slightly insane.  kris</td>', 'I don''t get it, I do but I don''t.  I see happy people hanging out on a viewpoint.  Is this a fear of heights?  I would crop down to remove the overexposed sky and crop from the right to remove what I think is hair or a thumb?  How about seeing what is slightly insane.  kris', '2002-07-08 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82943, 3084, 2373, '<td valign="top">i dont get it</td>', 'i dont get it', '2002-07-09 00:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82944, 3084, 2380, '<td valign="top">Please resubmit this week for general category</td>', 'Please resubmit this week for general category', '2002-07-09 04:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82945, 3084, 885, '<td valign="top">Hmm...not sure what Abseil is.  The water is pretty beautiful though.  Not sure what the people are doing, they don''t really look all that scared, so I think just the sign with the wall and the water would have been a whole lot more effective.</td>', 'Hmm...not sure what Abseil is.  The water is pretty beautiful though.  Not sure what the people are doing, they don''t really look all that scared, so I think just the sign with the wall and the water would have been a whole lot more effective.', '2002-07-09 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82946, 3084, 741, '<td valign="top">Nice colours but would have looked better without the 2 figures on the left.</td>', 'Nice colours but would have looked better without the 2 figures on the left.', '2002-07-09 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82947, 3084, 2152, '<td valign="top">The woman is really distracting.  I think your best bet here would have been to get a shot of the man sitting down from a high angle so you could see the drop below him better.  This just looks like a family vacation photo.</td>', 'The woman is really distracting.  I think your best bet here would have been to get a shot of the man sitting down from a high angle so you could see the drop below him better.  This just looks like a family vacation photo.', '2002-07-09 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82948, 3084, 2337, '<td valign="top">The sign suggests there is something to be afraid of here, but I have no idea what.  The dismembered arm  on the left hurt a bit.  Cropping could have made this a better shot, but unless you know what Absril Africa is, it''s not going to meet the challenge for me.  On a side note, I like the red hair against the blue sea.</td>', 'The sign suggests there is something to be afraid of here, but I have no idea what.  The dismembered arm  on the left hurt a bit.  Cropping could have made this a better shot, but unless you know what Absril Africa is, it''s not going to meet the challenge for me.  On a side note, I like the red hair against the blue sea.', '2002-07-09 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82949, 3084, 772, '<td valign="top">Fear of heights :)  I wonder why you didn''t photograph over the edge to show the height?  = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'Fear of heights :)  I wonder why you didn''t photograph over the edge to show the height?  = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-09 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82950, 3084, 2302, '<td valign="top">meeting challenge = 3. This would have been better if there were more perspective on the height. photo quality = 3. would have been nice if the woman did not have her back turned - or if she were closer to the wall looking over. total = 6</td>', 'meeting challenge = 3. This would have been better if there were more perspective on the height. photo quality = 3. would have been nice if the woman did not have her back turned - or if she were closer to the wall looking over. total = 6', '2002-07-09 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(82951, 3084, 1454, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2002-07-09 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
