(83044, 3089, 1759, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I just don''t get it. As for the technical merit, I find the lights distractive and the plane rather static. The plane is in focus, but too far off to make the tail readable or the subject very interesting.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I just don''t get it. As for the technical merit, I find the lights distractive and the plane rather static. The plane is in focus, but too far off to make the tail readable or the subject very interesting.', '2002-07-08 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83045, 3089, 1831, '<td valign="top">Like I''ve stated in afew comments. I see where your coming from but I don''t get an impression of fear. I would have liked to of seen a person in the image looking worried, concerned. Then I would be able to connect better.IMHO. Dogman ;]</td>', 'Like I''ve stated in afew comments. I see where your coming from but I don''t get an impression of fear. I would have liked to of seen a person in the image looking worried, concerned. Then I would be able to connect better.IMHO. Dogman ;]', '2002-07-09 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
