(83060, 3089, 1078, '<td valign="top">This is one of the Air Force One planes, right?  I''m not sure I understand why this is a fear.  If it had been a plane in flight, I would have got the fear of flying, but one on the ground seems a little bit harder to accept.  Beyond that, the picture is very dark (obviously, since it was taken at night) and kind of bland with the plane centered right in the middle of the photograph.</td>', 'This is one of the Air Force One planes, right?  I''m not sure I understand why this is a fear.  If it had been a plane in flight, I would have got the fear of flying, but one on the ground seems a little bit harder to accept.  Beyond that, the picture is very dark (obviously, since it was taken at night) and kind of bland with the plane centered right in the middle of the photograph.', '2002-07-14 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83061, 3089, 2700, '<td valign="top">cant belive this didn''t rank higher... if some dpchallenge guy can get this close to take a pic of the presidents'' plane, think of what some terrist could do...</td>', 'cant belive this didn''t rank higher... if some dpchallenge guy can get this close to take a pic of the presidents'' plane, think of what some terrist could do...', '2002-07-15 01:15:00.000000', NULL, 0),
