(83071, 3091, 1175, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot of this fish.  I love the lines and colors.  I just wish, for this challenge, the fear would be more apparent and I wouldn''t have to be smacked over the head with a large title.</td>', 'This is a cool shot of this fish.  I love the lines and colors.  I just wish, for this challenge, the fear would be more apparent and I wouldn''t have to be smacked over the head with a large title.', '2002-07-08 09:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83072, 3091, 1485, '<td valign="top">If I hadn''t looked at your title, I would have said very colorful, cheery, well-taken photo.  But it is not for this challenge.  Having to explain that the pipes are poisonous doesn''t work.</td>', 'If I hadn''t looked at your title, I would have said very colorful, cheery, well-taken photo.  But it is not for this challenge.  Having to explain that the pipes are poisonous doesn''t work.', '2002-07-08 09:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
