(83081, 3091, 509, '<td valign="top">Was the fish vertical like that, or was it the angle?  I think this might be better with either a close up of the fish''s face or a shot that has the whole fish in it.  Nice colors and focus though!</td>', 'Was the fish vertical like that, or was it the angle?  I think this might be better with either a close up of the fish''s face or a shot that has the whole fish in it.  Nice colors and focus though!', '2002-07-09 01:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
