(83085, 3091, 741, '<td valign="top">Yeah, but they''re only really dangerous at dusk ;)<br/>These are very, very tricky to photograph and this is pretty good.  I was about to put that the eye wasn''t sharp but of course that''s the false eye spot and the eye is nice and sharp (but well camouflaged).<br/>I''m afraid it just doesn''t say "fear" to me - now if it was a Titan triggerfish...</td>', 'Yeah, but they''re only really dangerous at dusk ;)These are very, very tricky to photograph and this is pretty good.  I was about to put that the eye wasn''t sharp but of course that''s the false eye spot and the eye is nice and sharp (but well camouflaged).I''m afraid it just doesn''t say "fear" to me - now if it was a Titan triggerfish...', '2002-07-09 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83086, 3091, 1019, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2002-07-09 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
