(83193, 3095, 1078, '<td valign="top">Different idea and a great experssion on her face.  I think this would have worked a lot better if it had been a tighter vertical crop mainly of her (almost like a portrait) and the hand holding the swab a little closer.  This would cut out all the unnecessary curtain space to the left and minimize the "clutter" on the wall behind.  The colors also seem just a tad off -- I''m guessing because you were shooting under fluorescent lights.</td>', 'Different idea and a great experssion on her face.  I think this would have worked a lot better if it had been a tighter vertical crop mainly of her (almost like a portrait) and the hand holding the swab a little closer.  This would cut out all the unnecessary curtain space to the left and minimize the "clutter" on the wall behind.  The colors also seem just a tad off -- I''m guessing because you were shooting under fluorescent lights.', '2002-07-15 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83194, 3095, 1330, '<td valign="top">She had been after us for months to let her get her tongue pierced but once there begged us to not let her go through with it. I would have put the pic with the needle in but by that time she had calmed down showing absolutely no fear. This week we let her sister have hers done and I had a great pic of the fear in her as the needle was passing through but a week late.<br/>Thanks for the constructive comments. They really have helped. <br/>D</td>', 'She had been after us for months to let her get her tongue pierced but once there begged us to not let her go through with it. I would have put the pic with the needle in but by that time she had calmed down showing absolutely no fear. This week we let her sister have hers done and I had a great pic of the fear in her as the needle was passing through but a week late.Thanks for the constructive comments. They really have helped. D', '2002-07-15 07:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
