(83229, 3098, 1450, '<td valign="top">a bit dull although it''s probably meant to be just doesn''t seem to work maybe for a shy challenge</td>', 'a bit dull although it''s probably meant to be just doesn''t seem to work maybe for a shy challenge', '2002-07-10 08:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83230, 3098, 885, '<td valign="top">I like the darkness of this image...convey''s the mood well, I think.  Is she supposed to be being hit?  I think it could have been interesting had you used a slightly longer shutter speed, and maybe gotten some motion blur in her hands moving up to that defensive position.  It seems a little stiff as is, and I wonder if it''s because she had to hold that pose on a sorta long exposure.</td>', 'I like the darkness of this image...convey''s the mood well, I think.  Is she supposed to be being hit?  I think it could have been interesting had you used a slightly longer shutter speed, and maybe gotten some motion blur in her hands moving up to that defensive position.  It seems a little stiff as is, and I wonder if it''s because she had to hold that pose on a sorta long exposure.', '2002-07-10 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83231, 3098, 737, '<td valign="top">Top 10 - I have no suggestions for improvement.</td>', 'Top 10 - I have no suggestions for improvement.', '2002-07-10 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83232, 3098, 2641, '<td valign="top">interesting picture but i dont see fear</td>', 'interesting picture but i dont see fear', '2002-07-10 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83233, 3098, 2650, '<td valign="top">very well done. *claps* beautiful girl as well.</td>', 'very well done. *claps* beautiful girl as well.', '2002-07-10 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83234, 3098, 1280, '<td valign="top">nice to see some expression of fear.  Nice job expressing fear...the theme that many didn''t express too well.  I gave yours the highest rating of all. 9 Grayce</td>', 'nice to see some expression of fear.  Nice job expressing fear...the theme that many didn''t express too well.  I gave yours the highest rating of all. 9 Grayce', '2002-07-10 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83235, 3098, 637, '<td valign="top">i don''t get it</td>', 'i don''t get it', '2002-07-11 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83236, 3098, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome, one of my favorite 3 this week.  Great colors, lighting, use of shadows. karmat</td>', 'Awesome, one of my favorite 3 this week.  Great colors, lighting, use of shadows. karmat', '2002-07-12 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83237, 3098, 2661, '<td valign="top">very moving.</td>', 'very moving.', '2002-07-13 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83238, 3098, 2221, '<td valign="top">strong photo! good contrast for that. i don''t know if that was especially chosen but if so it was a good decision to have the girl wear black cloths.<br/>unfortunatley the photo is a bit blurred. more sharpness would be nice.</td>', 'strong photo! good contrast for that. i don''t know if that was especially chosen but if so it was a good decision to have the girl wear black cloths.unfortunatley the photo is a bit blurred. more sharpness would be nice.', '2002-07-13 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83239, 3098, 2061, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice setup, the lighting is good, and the idea is very subjective and interpretive.  I''m not sure exactly what it means, but I like it.</td>', 'It''s a nice setup, the lighting is good, and the idea is very subjective and interpretive.  I''m not sure exactly what it means, but I like it.', '2002-07-14 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83240, 3098, 2091, '<td valign="top">not bad, good expression.</td>', 'not bad, good expression.', '2002-07-14 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83241, 3098, 2719, '<td valign="top">Sorry.</td>', 'Sorry.', '2002-07-14 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83242, 3098, 2860, '<td valign="top">I know that woman! It''s a good photo...but for some reason I can hear her laughing through this shot, not crying out from fear. Maybe it''s just me...</td>', 'I know that woman! It''s a good photo...but for some reason I can hear her laughing through this shot, not crying out from fear. Maybe it''s just me...', '2002-07-22 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(83243, 3100, 789, '<td valign="top">nice glock.</td>', 'nice glock.', '2002-07-08 07:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83244, 3100, 327, '<td valign="top">Dead eye...! Ya got my attention. Good work.</td>', 'Dead eye...! Ya got my attention. Good work.', '2002-07-08 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83245, 3100, 1897, '<td valign="top">what a poster for gun safety.  This makes me fear for my 2nd ammendment rights.</td>', 'what a poster for gun safety.  This makes me fear for my 2nd ammendment rights.', '2002-07-08 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83246, 3100, 1859, '<td valign="top">yikes.  not very often that id get to see THAT.  Cool shot.</td>', 'yikes.  not very often that id get to see THAT.  Cool shot.', '2002-07-08 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83247, 3100, 885, '<td valign="top">This is actually pretty powerful.  The depth of field is good, and the symmetry works well, I think.  I wouldn''t expect too many people to want to buy prints of this or anything, but I think it illustrates the challenge well.</td>', 'This is actually pretty powerful.  The depth of field is good, and the symmetry works well, I think.  I wouldn''t expect too many people to want to buy prints of this or anything, but I think it illustrates the challenge well.', '2002-07-08 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83248, 3100, 368, '<td valign="top">ok - i most certainly felt fear while looking at this shot ... hmmm no pun intended ... 7</td>', 'ok - i most certainly felt fear while looking at this shot ... hmmm no pun intended ... 7', '2002-07-08 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83249, 3100, 2146, '<td valign="top">Oh NO</td>', 'Oh NO', '2002-07-08 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83250, 3100, 661, '<td valign="top">Good detail.  Good composition.  The skin tones and black of the gun are good contrasts.</td>', 'Good detail.  Good composition.  The skin tones and black of the gun are good contrasts.', '2002-07-08 20:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83251, 3100, 1005, '<td valign="top">Been there, didn''t like that.  (police have terrible sense of humor)  Excellent shot.  Got me.  9 Swash</td>', 'Been there, didn''t like that.  (police have terrible sense of humor)  Excellent shot.  Got me.  9 Swash', '2002-07-08 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83252, 3100, 2247, '<td valign="top">I feel like: What did I do wrong against you?!?!  Very scary.</td>', 'I feel like: What did I do wrong against you?!?!  Very scary.', '2002-07-08 21:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83253, 3100, 92, '<td valign="top">ummmmm ok I''m scared ! This is FEAR !</td>', 'ummmmm ok I''m scared ! This is FEAR !', '2002-07-08 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83254, 3100, 1844, '<td valign="top">Best of them all. Not much competition this time unfortunately. But this photo looks real, makes you fell the fear. I like the anonimity of the shooter and the power of his hand. Very good composition. Powerful.</td>', 'Best of them all. Not much competition this time unfortunately. But this photo looks real, makes you fell the fear. I like the anonimity of the shooter and the power of his hand. Very good composition. Powerful.', '2002-07-09 02:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83255, 3100, 2380, '<td valign="top">would be nice if the perspecive was strong...... the fear element is 2 D here and so not frightening</td>', 'would be nice if the perspecive was strong...... the fear element is 2 D here and so not frightening', '2002-07-09 04:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83256, 3100, 133, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, but I prefer the black &amp; white version I saw entered.</td>', 'Nicely done, but I prefer the black & white version I saw entered.', '2002-07-09 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
