(83422, 3104, 1, '<td valign="top">very poor in terms of photography, but a nice image for fear.  first off, if your camera can''t do it, don''t take shots at night... it''ll just turn out dark/grainy as yours did.  second off, i think shooting the car headon would''ve worked more so for fear...  doesn''t really look like he got "you".</td>', 'very poor in terms of photography, but a nice image for fear.  first off, if your camera can''t do it, don''t take shots at night... it''ll just turn out dark/grainy as yours did.  second off, i think shooting the car headon would''ve worked more so for fear...  doesn''t really look like he got "you".', '2002-07-11 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
