(83519, 3109, 1005, '<td valign="top">Subtle, good shot for such low light (must be F707).  Suspense nicely portraited.  8 Swash</td>', 'Subtle, good shot for such low light (must be F707).  Suspense nicely portraited.  8 Swash', '2002-07-08 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83520, 3109, 2554, '<td valign="top">Nice Concept!</td>', 'Nice Concept!', '2002-07-08 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83521, 3109, 509, '<td valign="top">Wow, after seeing this one, I keep looking for something on the left side, you know, some creature or aparition = )  Great effect!  One of the few that really stands out! - 9</td>', 'Wow, after seeing this one, I keep looking for something on the left side, you know, some creature or aparition = )  Great effect!  One of the few that really stands out! - 9', '2002-07-09 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83522, 3109, 2380, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo.....out of context to some extent thoguh</td>', 'beautiful photo.....out of context to some extent thoguh', '2002-07-09 05:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83523, 3109, 1066, '<td valign="top">Some folks might say this is too dark..they may be right.  BUT..this is such a good idea..so perfect in execution UP TO THE DARK PART that I still have to place this a one of my top 10 this week....8...hokie</td>', 'Some folks might say this is too dark..they may be right.  BUT..this is such a good idea..so perfect in execution UP TO THE DARK PART that I still have to place this a one of my top 10 this week....8...hokie', '2002-07-09 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83524, 3109, 2370, '<td valign="top">nice expression, is the boy holding the candle? it might be better if his hand could be seen holding the candle..</td>', 'nice expression, is the boy holding the candle? it might be better if his hand could be seen holding the candle..', '2002-07-09 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83525, 3109, 2302, '<td valign="top">meeting challenge = 5. photo quality = 4 could have moved the candle just a bit closer to capture the expression - nice job. total = 9</td>', 'meeting challenge = 5. photo quality = 4 could have moved the candle just a bit closer to capture the expression - nice job. total = 9', '2002-07-09 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83526, 3109, 1454, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Kid''s expression could be better.</td>', 'Nice idea. Kid''s expression could be better.', '2002-07-09 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83527, 3109, 2638, '<td valign="top">very good picture</td>', 'very good picture', '2002-07-09 23:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83528, 3109, 811, '<td valign="top">The darkness and slight illumination on the kid''s face really sets a mood.  I know it is supposed to be dark, and on my monitor it is okay, but some people''s seem to be darker.  If you get a lot of comments to that end, sometimes it helps to submit a picture that is a shade or two brighter than what you really like.  It may lose a touch of the effect on some monitors, but it seems to insure that everyone can see the picture.</td>', 'The darkness and slight illumination on the kid''s face really sets a mood.  I know it is supposed to be dark, and on my monitor it is okay, but some people''s seem to be darker.  If you get a lot of comments to that end, sometimes it helps to submit a picture that is a shade or two brighter than what you really like.  It may lose a touch of the effect on some monitors, but it seems to insure that everyone can see the picture.', '2002-07-09 23:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83529, 3109, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent... the dark emptiness on the left of the frame leave plenty of room for my imagination to wonder what''s out there :) = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'excellent... the dark emptiness on the left of the frame leave plenty of room for my imagination to wonder what''s out there :) = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-09 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83530, 3109, 1944, '<td valign="top">One of the best interpertations of this theme in the challenge. Good capture. Shey.</td>', 'One of the best interpertations of this theme in the challenge. Good capture. Shey.', '2002-07-10 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83531, 3109, 2310, '<td valign="top">Nice atmosphere created in this photo...I like the subdued lighting</td>', 'Nice atmosphere created in this photo...I like the subdued lighting', '2002-07-10 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83532, 3109, 573, '<td valign="top">On second look, I realy like this picture even though the child''s face is darker than I would prefer.  My ten pick for this Challenge.</td>', 'On second look, I realy like this picture even though the child''s face is darker than I would prefer.  My ten pick for this Challenge.', '2002-07-10 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83533, 3109, 671, '<td valign="top">subject 10 lighting 10 focus 10 composition 8 total 9</td>', 'subject 10 lighting 10 focus 10 composition 8 total 9', '2002-07-10 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83534, 3109, 2647, '<td valign="top">I would rank this as an excelent picture in another catagory, It gives me the feeling of hope and life more than fear</td>', 'I would rank this as an excelent picture in another catagory, It gives me the feeling of hope and life more than fear', '2002-07-10 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83535, 3109, 637, '<td valign="top">nice image... not too fearful 3 sjgleah</td>', 'nice image... not too fearful 3 sjgleah', '2002-07-11 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83536, 3109, 2079, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Good color, I like the soft brown. Good skin tone and great expression.</td>', 'Nicely done. Good color, I like the soft brown. Good skin tone and great expression.', '2002-07-11 02:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83537, 3109, 2337, '<td valign="top">This one is growing on me as the week goes on... Bumping it up :)</td>', 'This one is growing on me as the week goes on... Bumping it up :)', '2002-07-11 03:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83538, 3109, 2095, '<td valign="top">a bit plain...</td>', 'a bit plain...', '2002-07-11 03:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83539, 3109, 715, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation of fear, but the bright candle is drawing my attention  too much to the center of the picture.</td>', 'Good interpretation of fear, but the bright candle is drawing my attention  too much to the center of the picture.', '2002-07-11 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83540, 3109, 828, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge well.  Well composed, great lighting.</td>', 'meets the challenge well.  Well composed, great lighting.', '2002-07-11 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83541, 3109, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good idea but I would have liked this better if the candle were placed on the left third instead of centered (tighter crop).</td>', 'Good idea but I would have liked this better if the candle were placed on the left third instead of centered (tighter crop).', '2002-07-12 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83542, 3109, 587, '<td valign="top">I like it but feel I want more. more light on childs face, perhaps some shadows where he thinks he sees something....good job though. cthenk</td>', 'I like it but feel I want more. more light on childs face, perhaps some shadows where he thinks he sees something....good job though. cthenk', '2002-07-12 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83543, 3109, 2466, '<td valign="top">just a wee bit brighter onthe face and it''d be so great.  Very ghostly!</td>', 'just a wee bit brighter onthe face and it''d be so great.  Very ghostly!', '2002-07-12 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83544, 3109, 2437, '<td valign="top">one can interpret a lot from this</td>', 'one can interpret a lot from this', '2002-07-13 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83545, 3109, 2700, '<td valign="top">great lighting!</td>', 'great lighting!', '2002-07-13 02:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83546, 3109, 878, '<td valign="top">I see dead people</td>', 'I see dead people', '2002-07-13 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83547, 3109, 2221, '<td valign="top">nice photo! good composition. the empty space on the left side creates room for the imaginary intruder, monster or whoever is "there". nice lighting also and a good expression on the boys face.<br/>i don''t know if it''s just my eyes who stared too much on monitors but i see square patterns around the light. maybe it''s bad jpeg compression or a limitation of the camera, no points lost for that.<br/>i like this photo.<br/>only trifle is the strange blot between the candle and the face. almost looks like i touched my monitor there, but it moves when i scroll the photo up and down ;-)</td>', 'nice photo! good composition. the empty space on the left side creates room for the imaginary intruder, monster or whoever is "there". nice lighting also and a good expression on the boys face.i don''t know if it''s just my eyes who stared too much on monitors but i see square patterns around the light. maybe it''s bad jpeg compression or a limitation of the camera, no points lost for that.i like this photo.only trifle is the strange blot between the candle and the face. almost looks like i touched my monitor there, but it moves when i scroll the photo up and down ;-)', '2002-07-13 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83548, 3109, 2615, '<td valign="top">one of the better ideas for this subject, however needs to be a little sharper and would like to see just slightly more light on the face.</td>', 'one of the better ideas for this subject, however needs to be a little sharper and would like to see just slightly more light on the face.', '2002-07-14 04:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83549, 3109, 441, '<td valign="top">nice work, spooky shadows would help</td>', 'nice work, spooky shadows would help', '2002-07-14 19:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83550, 3109, 1078, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but it seems a little dark on my monitor -- was the boy just lit by the candle?  If so, maybe a little extra light shining on his face would help.  I like all the other black space on the other side of the image.  Leaves us straining to look for something in the dark just as the boy is.</td>', 'Good idea, but it seems a little dark on my monitor -- was the boy just lit by the candle?  If so, maybe a little extra light shining on his face would help.  I like all the other black space on the other side of the image.  Leaves us straining to look for something in the dark just as the boy is.', '2002-07-14 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83551, 3109, 933, '<td valign="top">Neat photo.  I like the use of empty space.</td>', 'Neat photo.  I like the use of empty space.', '2002-07-15 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83552, 3109, 734, '<td valign="top">I thought this was going to be the winner,... Wonderful lighting .. great job!</td>', 'I thought this was going to be the winner,... Wonderful lighting .. great job!', '2002-07-16 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(83553, 3109, 1831, '<td valign="top">Thanks ezns and every1 else for the comments. much appreciated.<br/>The dead space was put there on purpose in order to force you to look for something in it.<br/>On reflection , a little more light on my sons face would of helped. I am pleased with the effect considering the constraints of a point and shoot camera and think it looks great in my gallery on Pbase, where the background is also black. Thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks ezns and every1 else for the comments. much appreciated.The dead space was put there on purpose in order to force you to look for something in it.On reflection , a little more light on my sons face would of helped. I am pleased with the effect considering the constraints of a point and shoot camera and think it looks great in my gallery on Pbase, where the background is also black. Thanks again.', '2002-07-17 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(83554, 3111, 1877, '<td valign="top">This is great! Shock/surprise/fear- very evident.. but i like how sharp the black and white is.. very good. 8</td>', 'This is great! Shock/surprise/fear- very evident.. but i like how sharp the black and white is.. very good. 8', '2002-07-08 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83555, 3111, 1485, '<td valign="top">not sincere enough</td>', 'not sincere enough', '2002-07-08 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83556, 3111, 2199, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, lighting -- very well done. Update: I''ve finished voting for the week (will do some minor juggling and comments later), and this is my favorite Fear photograph. Great job! (10)</td>', 'Excellent composition, lighting -- very well done. Update: I''ve finished voting for the week (will do some minor juggling and comments later), and this is my favorite Fear photograph. Great job! (10)', '2002-07-08 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83557, 3111, 2123, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Wish I could see what she''s so afraid of...lol</td>', 'Wow!  Wish I could see what she''s so afraid of...lol', '2002-07-08 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83558, 3111, 2152, '<td valign="top">I think you took the levels and sharpening a little too far, but a good shot nonetheless.  Also, the outline of the leftmost finger doesn''t look natural.</td>', 'I think you took the levels and sharpening a little too far, but a good shot nonetheless.  Also, the outline of the leftmost finger doesn''t look natural.', '2002-07-08 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83559, 3111, 1759, '<td valign="top">Wow! Good job from your model and good job with composition, lighting, and exposure. Overall a very good photo indeed!</td>', 'Wow! Good job from your model and good job with composition, lighting, and exposure. Overall a very good photo indeed!', '2002-07-08 22:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83560, 3111, 2373, '<td valign="top">ya, thats pretty good</td>', 'ya, thats pretty good', '2002-07-09 00:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83561, 3111, 2311, '<td valign="top">you should be in the theaters...</td>', 'you should be in the theaters...', '2002-07-09 00:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83562, 3111, 2380, '<td valign="top">ONly face photo af all people captured in natural pose....which actually strikes fear ! Good modelling ...and so a great photo !</td>', 'ONly face photo af all people captured in natural pose....which actually strikes fear ! Good modelling ...and so a great photo !', '2002-07-09 04:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83563, 3111, 133, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a facial expression!</td>', 'Wow, what a facial expression!', '2002-07-09 08:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83564, 3111, 1175, '<td valign="top">I like the sharpness of this photo and the big bulging eyes.  That hand though looks strange.  You want to try to never cut off a limb that way.  This photo probably would have done better without the hand.</td>', 'I like the sharpness of this photo and the big bulging eyes.  That hand though looks strange.  You want to try to never cut off a limb that way.  This photo probably would have done better without the hand.', '2002-07-09 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83565, 3111, 2261, '<td valign="top">Those eyes!!! True terror!</td>', 'Those eyes!!! True terror!', '2002-07-09 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83566, 3111, 1748, '<td valign="top">best of this type of image</td>', 'best of this type of image', '2002-07-09 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83567, 3111, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to separate fear from shock, which is very well represented here.  Good focus/contrast/framing.  (a photoshop touch up with something dangerous clearly reflected in her eyes would be GREAT!, but illegal here.)  7 Swash</td>', 'It''s hard to separate fear from shock, which is very well represented here.  Good focus/contrast/framing.  (a photoshop touch up with something dangerous clearly reflected in her eyes would be GREAT!, but illegal here.)  7 Swash', '2002-07-09 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83568, 3111, 2200, '<td valign="top">Face seems too relaxed to be scared</td>', 'Face seems too relaxed to be scared', '2002-07-09 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83569, 3111, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is "SO 60''s" - nicely done as B/W - good chioce. Quite a bit of light reflecting in the eyes, Perhaps an indirect flash?</td>', 'This is "SO 60''s" - nicely done as B/W - good chioce. Quite a bit of light reflecting in the eyes, Perhaps an indirect flash?', '2002-07-10 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83570, 3111, 885, '<td valign="top">Great eyes.  I like this photo...but I think I''d like even better a photo with just a close up of those eyes with the whites all around them.  And the eyebrows too.</td>', 'Great eyes.  I like this photo...but I think I''d like even better a photo with just a close up of those eyes with the whites all around them.  And the eyebrows too.', '2002-07-10 10:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83571, 3111, 641, '<td valign="top">Good use of the whole frame. Would suggest though maybe some softening of the shot. I looks a little pixely or something (like my use of technical terms?LOL)</td>', 'Good use of the whole frame. Would suggest though maybe some softening of the shot. I looks a little pixely or something (like my use of technical terms?LOL)', '2002-07-10 10:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83572, 3111, 1856, '<td valign="top">Nice use of b&amp;w to help convey the fear.  Great expression.  Nit pick...the reflection in her eyes looks like it''s broad daylight (window light).  It may have been better to shoot in dark room with artificial light.  I''d never notice this while shooting though. :P  Great shot!  9 Lisa</td>', 'Nice use of b&w to help convey the fear.  Great expression.  Nit pick...the reflection in her eyes looks like it''s broad daylight (window light).  It may have been better to shoot in dark room with artificial light.  I''d never notice this while shooting though. :P  Great shot!  9 Lisa', '2002-07-10 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83573, 3111, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love the old fashioned quality of this photo.  Very nice!</td>', 'I love the old fashioned quality of this photo.  Very nice!', '2002-07-11 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83574, 3111, 772, '<td valign="top">all i can say on this one is excellent :) = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'all i can say on this one is excellent :) = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-11 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83575, 3111, 1019, '<td valign="top">great bug eye look</td>', 'great bug eye look', '2002-07-11 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83576, 3111, 2604, '<td valign="top">This picture looks more like disbelief to me</td>', 'This picture looks more like disbelief to me', '2002-07-11 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83577, 3111, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great shot, excellent lighting.</td>', 'Great shot, excellent lighting.', '2002-07-11 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83578, 3111, 2052, '<td valign="top">is that laura branigan?</td>', 'is that laura branigan?', '2002-07-12 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83579, 3111, 2686, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to decide if she looks scared or if I should be scared of her!  lol.  Like the title.</td>', 'I''m trying to decide if she looks scared or if I should be scared of her!  lol.  Like the title.', '2002-07-12 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83580, 3111, 255, '<td valign="top">i cant even look at her eyes! very nicely done fear shot! cool framing, too. 9-amitchell</td>', 'i cant even look at her eyes! very nicely done fear shot! cool framing, too. 9-amitchell', '2002-07-13 04:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83581, 3111, 2702, '<td valign="top">a strange photo</td>', 'a strange photo', '2002-07-13 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83582, 3111, 878, '<td valign="top">Good fear shot,  I feel the quality of the image suffers a little from the sharpness filter.  The edges around the face and hands on the lowe part of the shot are slightly jagged.  Overall 7</td>', 'Good fear shot,  I feel the quality of the image suffers a little from the sharpness filter.  The edges around the face and hands on the lowe part of the shot are slightly jagged.  Overall 7', '2002-07-13 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83583, 3111, 554, '<td valign="top">Good job. I like the framing and the buldgeing eyes</td>', 'Good job. I like the framing and the buldgeing eyes', '2002-07-14 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83584, 3111, 1078, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W.  Great range of tones (even if maybe a LITTLE too dark, but I think it works).  Perfect expression.  Doesn''t make me want to laugh like some of the others this week because this looks "straight" and not posed -- like you actually caught someone in the act of being frightened.</td>', 'Nice B&W.  Great range of tones (even if maybe a LITTLE too dark, but I think it works).  Perfect expression.  Doesn''t make me want to laugh like some of the others this week because this looks "straight" and not posed -- like you actually caught someone in the act of being frightened.', '2002-07-14 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83585, 3111, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like how clearly I can see the eyes. The expression on the model seems more surprised, to me, than fearful. Anyway I give you an 8 and I''ve given very few of them.</td>', 'I like how clearly I can see the eyes. The expression on the model seems more surprised, to me, than fearful. Anyway I give you an 8 and I''ve given very few of them.', '2002-07-14 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83586, 3111, 210, '<td valign="top">Beautifully terrifying, emulating classic horror.  If I had a choice, this would win this week.</td>', 'Beautifully terrifying, emulating classic horror.  If I had a choice, this would win this week.', '2002-07-14 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83587, 3111, 2719, '<td valign="top">Fear or shock/dismay?  Great graphic quality.</td>', 'Fear or shock/dismay?  Great graphic quality.', '2002-07-14 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83588, 3111, 368, '<td valign="top">Thank you to everyone who voted ... and that "model" is me :) - I have a view finder that rotates and i can see myself taking the photo .. so i played with it - and voila - that''s what i got :) - it kinda reminds me of an older horror film image - and that''s what i was trying to portray ... thanks again to everyone :)</td>', 'Thank you to everyone who voted ... and that "model" is me :) - I have a view finder that rotates and i can see myself taking the photo .. so i played with it - and voila - that''s what i got :) - it kinda reminds me of an older horror film image - and that''s what i was trying to portray ... thanks again to everyone :)', '2002-07-15 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(83589, 3112, 1143, '<td valign="top">I woulda focused on the needle since that''s what really scares people.</td>', 'I woulda focused on the needle since that''s what really scares people.', '2002-07-08 01:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83590, 3112, 1877, '<td valign="top">I think the focus should be in the foreground not the background. Good concept though! 5</td>', 'I think the focus should be in the foreground not the background. Good concept though! 5', '2002-07-08 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
