(83598, 3112, 2152, '<td valign="top">I think this would be more effective if the focus was on the syringe, but I think I see where you''re going.  The blob in the lower right is distracting.  It could have easily been cropped out.  I think the composition could be better too, maybe if there was a person in the shot with their mouth open.</td>', 'I think this would be more effective if the focus was on the syringe, but I think I see where you''re going.  The blob in the lower right is distracting.  It could have easily been cropped out.  I think the composition could be better too, maybe if there was a person in the shot with their mouth open.', '2002-07-08 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
