(83667, 3113, 2310, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments!  I''m amazed that I am in the top 10 with the score I got.  The green spot is a dead pixel which shows up in low light situations.  The mask is a Michael Myers ("Halloween") mask that I have had since High School (~10 years ago).  I pretty much just propped the head up on  a sheet covered vacuum in front of another black sheet with a work lamp pointed at the mask.  I then placed myself close to the camera for the close up "wild-eyed" effect...</td>', 'Thanks for the comments!  I''m amazed that I am in the top 10 with the score I got.  The green spot is a dead pixel which shows up in low light situations.  The mask is a Michael Myers ("Halloween") mask that I have had since High School (~10 years ago).  I pretty much just propped the head up on  a sheet covered vacuum in front of another black sheet with a work lamp pointed at the mask.  I then placed myself close to the camera for the close up "wild-eyed" effect...', '2002-07-15 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
