(83724, 3114, 828, '<td valign="top">a wonderful picture!  But the goat''s crazy.</td>', 'a wonderful picture!  But the goat''s crazy.', '2002-07-11 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83725, 3114, 806, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture! Wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture! Wouldn''t change a thing.', '2002-07-11 22:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83726, 3114, 2091, '<td valign="top">sweet shot :)</td>', 'sweet shot :)', '2002-07-11 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83727, 3114, 2279, '<td valign="top">great pic....one of the few 10s i gave</td>', 'great pic....one of the few 10s i gave', '2002-07-12 03:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83728, 3114, 878, '<td valign="top">This is a great photograph.  The fear factor for me is the height.  Dont care too much for the title, yes the animal is fearless but I think something like "A long way down" would of worked better for this challenge.</td>', 'This is a great photograph.  The fear factor for me is the height.  Dont care too much for the title, yes the animal is fearless but I think something like "A long way down" would of worked better for this challenge.', '2002-07-12 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83729, 3114, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is a great photograph!   It appears that you caught it during the :Sweet Light" period of either early morning or evening.   This has given the background rich color as well as just enough light to properly expose the subject.   Very inspiring, but may not do real well because most will think it misses a direct hit on fear.   You deserve a 9 from Autool.</td>', 'This is a great photograph!   It appears that you caught it during the :Sweet Light" period of either early morning or evening.   This has given the background rich color as well as just enough light to properly expose the subject.   Very inspiring, but may not do real well because most will think it misses a direct hit on fear.   You deserve a 9 from Autool.', '2002-07-12 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83730, 3114, 616, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot! It''s great how that goat creature is looking down the canyon.</td>', 'This is a great shot! It''s great how that goat creature is looking down the canyon.', '2002-07-12 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83731, 3114, 661, '<td valign="top">Nice catch.</td>', 'Nice catch.', '2002-07-13 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83732, 3114, 2481, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach - fearLESS -  nice photo, good color, contrast and lighting works well too</td>', 'Interesting approach - fearLESS -  nice photo, good color, contrast and lighting works well too', '2002-07-13 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83733, 3114, 527, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t fearless mean a lack of fear? Maybe it would have worked better for a fearless contest.<br/><br/>4  -Tim</td>', 'Doesn''t fearless mean a lack of fear? Maybe it would have worked better for a fearless contest.4  -Tim', '2002-07-13 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83734, 3114, 308, '<td valign="top">Really clear, sharp, and beautiful photo.  One of my favorites this week.</td>', 'Really clear, sharp, and beautiful photo.  One of my favorites this week.', '2002-07-14 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83735, 3114, 1323, '<td valign="top">great picture, my favorite this week, wish the further part of the canyon wasn''t so dull (if that is the correct description), it just seems a ltitle too bright and maybe a little blurry</td>', 'great picture, my favorite this week, wish the further part of the canyon wasn''t so dull (if that is the correct description), it just seems a ltitle too bright and maybe a little blurry', '2002-07-14 02:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83736, 3114, 2, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe you got a shot like this.  Your DOF really gives us the sense of enormity of the canyon.</td>', 'I can''t believe you got a shot like this.  Your DOF really gives us the sense of enormity of the canyon.', '2002-07-14 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83737, 3114, 554, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I know if I were where you were I would be somewhat fearful. 9</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I know if I were where you were I would be somewhat fearful. 9', '2002-07-14 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83738, 3114, 1078, '<td valign="top">Great shot -- wish the colors in the background weren''t so flat -- but I also know how hard it can be to bring them out when you''re talking that kind of distance.  (After the competition''s over, play with it in an editing program.)  What I really want to know is what it''s looking at....</td>', 'Great shot -- wish the colors in the background weren''t so flat -- but I also know how hard it can be to bring them out when you''re talking that kind of distance.  (After the competition''s over, play with it in an editing program.)  What I really want to know is what it''s looking at....', '2002-07-14 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83739, 3114, 441, '<td valign="top">super shot</td>', 'super shot', '2002-07-14 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83740, 3114, 1993, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot, but I''m not entirely sure where the ''fear'' is.</td>', 'It''s a nice shot, but I''m not entirely sure where the ''fear'' is.', '2002-07-14 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83741, 3114, 2095, '<td valign="top">Whoa</td>', 'Whoa', '2002-07-14 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83742, 3114, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really LOVE this picture!  For me, it does fall into the realm of fear (of heights), but it is really just the picture as a whole that appeals to me.</td>', 'I really LOVE this picture!  For me, it does fall into the realm of fear (of heights), but it is really just the picture as a whole that appeals to me.', '2002-07-14 20:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83743, 3114, 2719, '<td valign="top">TIme and place. Wow!</td>', 'TIme and place. Wow!', '2002-07-14 21:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83744, 3114, 210, '<td valign="top">The best non-horror-ish picture this week, I think.  It''s not comical like most came out, but downright satisfying in the guts because when you look at it, you''re inevitably forced to put yourself in the position of the animal.</td>', 'The best non-horror-ish picture this week, I think.  It''s not comical like most came out, but downright satisfying in the guts because when you look at it, you''re inevitably forced to put yourself in the position of the animal.', '2002-07-14 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83745, 3114, 933, '<td valign="top">Just a tad soft on the focus, but otherwise a really nice shot.  Great luck to happen to catch this moment!  Nice colors, good composition.  Well done.</td>', 'Just a tad soft on the focus, but otherwise a really nice shot.  Great luck to happen to catch this moment!  Nice colors, good composition.  Well done.', '2002-07-14 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83746, 3114, 2649, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.</td>', 'Excellent photo.', '2002-07-15 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83747, 3114, 772, '<td valign="top">Jakob, congrats on the win :)</td>', 'Jakob, congrats on the win :)', '2002-07-15 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(83748, 3114, 806, '<td valign="top">Again, nice capture! Great detail! CONGRATS!</td>', 'Again, nice capture! Great detail! CONGRATS!', '2002-07-15 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(83749, 3114, 2244, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments!  I must say that I am very happy to get this win after just a few participations in the dpchallenge (that I think is a terrific concept BTW)!  Thanks to your votes I realized that this picture may actually have some potential........here''s what the photo editor of one of the major US wildlife magazines said: "It''s a perfectly good photo, very dramatic."  I was obviously very excited by this feedback!  We''ll see what happens, maybe this will be my first photo sale ever?!?!  Good luck with "texture" challenge everyone!  Jakob aka Chakkobbo<br/><br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments!  I must say that I am very happy to get this win after just a few participations in the dpchallenge (that I think is a terrific concept BTW)!  Thanks to your votes I realized that this picture may actually have some potential........here''s what the photo editor of one of the major US wildlife magazines said: "It''s a perfectly good photo, very dramatic."  I was obviously very excited by this feedback!  We''ll see what happens, maybe this will be my first photo sale ever?!?!  Good luck with "texture" challenge everyone!  Jakob aka Chakkobbo', '2002-07-15 02:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(83750, 3114, 587, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your win, an awesome photo.  Good luck on your sale!  Look forward to more good things from you. :)</td>', 'Congrats on your win, an awesome photo.  Good luck on your sale!  Look forward to more good things from you. :)', '2002-07-15 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(83751, 3114, 1569, '<td valign="top">Great photo,congrats on first place!!!</td>', 'Great photo,congrats on first place!!!', '2002-07-16 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(83752, 3114, 818, '<td valign="top">you caught the moment...beautiful pic indeed. thumbs up!</td>', 'you caught the moment...beautiful pic indeed. thumbs up!', '2002-07-17 06:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(83753, 3114, 2783, '<td valign="top">You''ve got to be the luckiest man alive to get that shot<br/><br/> -10</td>', 'You''ve got to be the luckiest man alive to get that shot -10', '2002-07-19 02:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(83754, 3114, 51167, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture.  I can''t believe the goat would go to the edge like that.</td>', 'Awesome picture.  I can''t believe the goat would go to the edge like that.', '2002-08-14 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(83755, 3114, 3746, '<td valign="top">Perfect example of the rule of thirds! Can you imagine how average this photo would of been without the photographers keen eye??</td>', 'Perfect example of the rule of thirds! Can you imagine how average this photo would of been without the photographers keen eye??', '2002-10-13 05:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
