(83759, 3115, 2343, '<td valign="top">Too exposed and uninspiring to me.  Without the title this just tells me that in Alabama you can get a 5th of Bacardi to go with your rental car.  Good idea but more impact would be a car crash.  I would stage this with a blank background, focus better and work on that overexposure.</td>', 'Too exposed and uninspiring to me.  Without the title this just tells me that in Alabama you can get a 5th of Bacardi to go with your rental car.  Good idea but more impact would be a car crash.  I would stage this with a blank background, focus better and work on that overexposure.', '2002-07-08 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83760, 3115, 2146, '<td valign="top">if you woul have laid this in the street, now that wuld have said it</td>', 'if you woul have laid this in the street, now that wuld have said it', '2002-07-08 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83761, 3115, 117, '<td valign="top">the bottle should have been almost empty</td>', 'the bottle should have been almost empty', '2002-07-08 21:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83762, 3115, 885, '<td valign="top">Yes, drunk drivers are something to fear.  But this bottle doesn''t even look open, and the map doesn''t really give enough context to driving.  An empty bottle next to a car wheel would have been more representative, I think.</td>', 'Yes, drunk drivers are something to fear.  But this bottle doesn''t even look open, and the map doesn''t really give enough context to driving.  An empty bottle next to a car wheel would have been more representative, I think.', '2002-07-09 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
