(83783, 3115, 2466, '<td valign="top">thank you for all of your comments.  I tried this with the map folded out, but you couldn''t see the roads clearly.  Being 10, I didn''t want to pour a drink to amke it clearer, but the comments here show me I could''ve used water or something to make it more dramatic.</td>', 'thank you for all of your comments.  I tried this with the map folded out, but you couldn''t see the roads clearly.  Being 10, I didn''t want to pour a drink to amke it clearer, but the comments here show me I could''ve used water or something to make it more dramatic.', '2002-07-15 09:10:00.000000', NULL, 0),
