(83789, 3116, 2337, '<td valign="top">At first view i voted this very low cause I didn''t see the fear.  Just looked kind of fuzzy and blurred, but as I looked at it looking for a comment, it''s grown on me.  I think the fear here is a regional thing though.  City folks with railroad crossing gates most likely won''t relate.</td>', 'At first view i voted this very low cause I didn''t see the fear.  Just looked kind of fuzzy and blurred, but as I looked at it looking for a comment, it''s grown on me.  I think the fear here is a regional thing though.  City folks with railroad crossing gates most likely won''t relate.', '2002-07-09 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
