(83796, 3116, 772, '<td valign="top">This is good!  railroad crossings are a fear for a lot of people.  I know this would have been impractical, but if you could have caught a train half way through the crossing, i think it would have been great! (I''m not lowering my score because of that though :))  good work! = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is good!  railroad crossings are a fear for a lot of people.  I know this would have been impractical, but if you could have caught a train half way through the crossing, i think it would have been great! (I''m not lowering my score because of that though :))  good work! = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-11 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
