(83818, 3118, 2337, '<td valign="top">Challenge was meet (at least for me) but the black streak kind of hides the skater''s head.  I don''t know if you had control over your subject (although he/she appears to be a teen so I doubt it) but if you could have gotten them into better light without whatever caused that black streak, I think you would have had a ''hang on the wall'' shot.</td>', 'Challenge was meet (at least for me) but the black streak kind of hides the skater''s head.  I don''t know if you had control over your subject (although he/she appears to be a teen so I doubt it) but if you could have gotten them into better light without whatever caused that black streak, I think you would have had a ''hang on the wall'' shot.', '2002-07-10 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83819, 3118, 573, '<td valign="top">Too dark and so much motion blur I can''t tell what is going on.</td>', 'Too dark and so much motion blur I can''t tell what is going on.', '2002-07-10 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83820, 3118, 1041, '<td valign="top">no fear was not the challenge topic!  as for the photo, motion blur is great, and would work well, but then the subject should be in focus and the background blurred or vice versa.  not both.  photo''s also too dark.  -- gr8photos (2)</td>', 'no fear was not the challenge topic!  as for the photo, motion blur is great, and would work well, but then the subject should be in focus and the background blurred or vice versa.  not both.  photo''s also too dark.  -- gr8photos (2)', '2002-07-11 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
