(83827, 3118, 2719, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Great action, color, composition.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Great action, color, composition.', '2002-07-14 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83828, 3118, 2221, '<td valign="top">Wow, never had such varying comments :-)<br/>I knew it was too dark outside when I shot this photo. Aperture already was as wide as possible. Also couldn''t increase shutter speed without making it even darker. I wanted to reshoot this one another day but hadn''t the time for it (neither my "subject"). I still thought it was better than my spider shot ;-)<br/>In post editing I could have made it lighter but it looked ok on my monitor (night, dimly lit room). When I got to work next day, I was shocked to see how dark it was. Well... learnt another thing this week ;-)<br/>We tried a lot and I experienced it being extremly difficult to shoot at the right moment and move the camera with the right speed to have the subject in focus.<br/>Anyway, thanks to everybody who broaded their mind and didn''t rate it low just because "No Fear" is not "Fear". Why do you know that this kid really has no fear? Just because of the title? It''s just my interpretation.<br/>Also thanks to everybody who despite of the technical flaws recognized the idea.</td>', 'Wow, never had such varying comments :-)I knew it was too dark outside when I shot this photo. Aperture already was as wide as possible. Also couldn''t increase shutter speed without making it even darker. I wanted to reshoot this one another day but hadn''t the time for it (neither my "subject"). I still thought it was better than my spider shot ;-)In post editing I could have made it lighter but it looked ok on my monitor (night, dimly lit room). When I got to work next day, I was shocked to see how dark it was. Well... learnt another thing this week ;-)We tried a lot and I experienced it being extremly difficult to shoot at the right moment and move the camera with the right speed to have the subject in focus.Anyway, thanks to everybody who broaded their mind and didn''t rate it low just because "No Fear" is not "Fear". Why do you know that this kid really has no fear? Just because of the title? It''s just my interpretation.Also thanks to everybody who despite of the technical flaws recognized the idea.', '2002-07-15 08:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(83829, 3119, 1686, '<td valign="top">A common fear but the lesions in the picture all look benign</td>', 'A common fear but the lesions in the picture all look benign', '2002-07-08 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83830, 3119, 772, '<td valign="top">I can definitely understand the ''fear'' in this photo, but the photo is not appealing to me.  = 4 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I can definitely understand the ''fear'' in this photo, but the photo is not appealing to me.  = 4 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-08 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83831, 3119, 436, '<td valign="top">no, just a picture of your arm :)</td>', 'no, just a picture of your arm :)', '2002-07-08 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83832, 3119, 2146, '<td valign="top">I lost my mom to that...Yes it is a bigger fear now...</td>', 'I lost my mom to that...Yes it is a bigger fear now...', '2002-07-08 20:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83833, 3119, 2373, '<td valign="top">oooo</td>', 'oooo', '2002-07-09 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83834, 3119, 92, '<td valign="top">I think this crazy weather is making me sick....<br/><br/>*gasp*<br/>Maybe I have a tumor? In my throat...and I''ll be dead in 24 hours! Or some rare illness that hasn''t been discovered yet. And I''ll die before they find a cure! What''s this? What''s on my arm? Is that a rash?! Skin cancer! Wait...what the hell am I typing?<br/><br/>I can''t see the screen! I''M BLIND!! Oh wait...just my hair in front of my face....*sigh*<br/><br/>Okay...whew. I thought th- you hear that? Am I the only one that hears that? Is that the sound of my brain hemorrhaging?<br/><br/>I think<br/>I''m gonna<br/><br/>faint<br/></td>', 'I think this crazy weather is making me sick....*gasp*Maybe I have a tumor? In my throat...and I''ll be dead in 24 hours! Or some rare illness that hasn''t been discovered yet. And I''ll die before they find a cure! What''s this? What''s on my arm? Is that a rash?! Skin cancer! Wait...what the hell am I typing?I can''t see the screen! I''M BLIND!! Oh wait...just my hair in front of my face....*sigh*Okay...whew. I thought th- you hear that? Am I the only one that hears that? Is that the sound of my brain hemorrhaging?I thinkI''m gonnafaint', '2002-07-09 00:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83835, 3119, 368, '<td valign="top">i think if you are trying to portray some fear into someone with skin cancer i would have chosen a larger freckle or even a mole ...</td>', 'i think if you are trying to portray some fear into someone with skin cancer i would have chosen a larger freckle or even a mole ...', '2002-07-09 02:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83836, 3119, 1882, '<td valign="top">one can only hope....</td>', 'one can only hope....', '2002-07-09 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83837, 3119, 1831, '<td valign="top">I ''ve had a mole removed because of a fear of this so I know where your coming from...However, I don''t get an impression of fear. The title carries the photograph. I would have prefered to have seen the whole person looking concerned carrying out  a self examination. That would of better represented the concern (Fear). Just my $.02. Dogman :]</td>', 'I ''ve had a mole removed because of a fear of this so I know where your coming from...However, I don''t get an impression of fear. The title carries the photograph. I would have prefered to have seen the whole person looking concerned carrying out  a self examination. That would of better represented the concern (Fear). Just my $.02. Dogman :]', '2002-07-09 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
