(83850, 3119, 1078, '<td valign="top">While it''s a great fear -- and one I''ve already experienced, this shot is simply not interesting to me in the least.</td>', 'While it''s a great fear -- and one I''ve already experienced, this shot is simply not interesting to me in the least.', '2002-07-14 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83851, 3120, 436, '<td valign="top">very good macro.  what are they crawling on?  Tad bright at top, otherwise, very nice</td>', 'very good macro.  what are they crawling on?  Tad bright at top, otherwise, very nice', '2002-07-08 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83852, 3120, 2123, '<td valign="top">Yuck, yuck, yuck!!!  Definitely MY worst fear!  The top evil creature is a little over exposed, but I wouldn''t have wanted to hang around too long to get this shot so it''s forgiven...lol.</td>', 'Yuck, yuck, yuck!!!  Definitely MY worst fear!  The top evil creature is a little over exposed, but I wouldn''t have wanted to hang around too long to get this shot so it''s forgiven...lol.', '2002-07-08 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83853, 3120, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but it looks as if it isn''t a photo</td>', 'Nice picture but it looks as if it isn''t a photo', '2002-07-08 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83854, 3120, 1569, '<td valign="top">This is great--really nasty bugs.</td>', 'This is great--really nasty bugs.', '2002-07-08 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83855, 3120, 885, '<td valign="top">Neat macro view of the yellowjackets.  Not sure about them being cut off though, and also I''m not sure about that background.</td>', 'Neat macro view of the yellowjackets.  Not sure about them being cut off though, and also I''m not sure about that background.', '2002-07-08 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83856, 3120, 1759, '<td valign="top">I hate those guys! You have some problems with lighting, but otherwise a really cool photo.</td>', 'I hate those guys! You have some problems with lighting, but otherwise a really cool photo.', '2002-07-08 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83857, 3120, 2380, '<td valign="top">good composition...... creates fear. i thought I got surrounded by them !</td>', 'good composition...... creates fear. i thought I got surrounded by them !', '2002-07-09 04:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83858, 3120, 1, '<td valign="top">Seems overexposed, try a different exposure settings (faster shutter mostly).  Also your composure needs work -- all the bees are on the outside, you have no point of focus for viewers.</td>', 'Seems overexposed, try a different exposure settings (faster shutter mostly).  Also your composure needs work -- all the bees are on the outside, you have no point of focus for viewers.', '2002-07-09 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83859, 3120, 472, '<td valign="top">what are they crawling on? great colors. did you get this iwth a telefoto?</td>', 'what are they crawling on? great colors. did you get this iwth a telefoto?', '2002-07-09 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83860, 3120, 2638, '<td valign="top">the colors are great</td>', 'the colors are great', '2002-07-09 23:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83861, 3120, 2172, '<td valign="top">Nice photography and colors.  I could definately see ''fear'' for someone who has a phobia of bees.  The close up works to the advantage.  Great work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Nice photography and colors.  I could definately see ''fear'' for someone who has a phobia of bees.  The close up works to the advantage.  Great work.Ruthann', '2002-07-10 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83862, 3120, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ohhh how I hate wasps!  Great photo!  Very minor problems, but as a shot of opportunity, this is VERY well done.  9 Swash</td>', 'Ohhh how I hate wasps!  Great photo!  Very minor problems, but as a shot of opportunity, this is VERY well done.  9 Swash', '2002-07-10 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83863, 3120, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting image!  I''m not sure what this items is that the bees are on, but its neat :) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting image!  I''m not sure what this items is that the bees are on, but its neat :) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-11 07:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83864, 3120, 1024, '<td valign="top">This image is very sharp and clear.  I can clearly see the fear that this would invoke.  Nicely done.  9  BAMartin</td>', 'This image is very sharp and clear.  I can clearly see the fear that this would invoke.  Nicely done.  9  BAMartin', '2002-07-11 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83865, 3120, 1019, '<td valign="top">great colours</td>', 'great colours', '2002-07-11 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83866, 3120, 587, '<td valign="top">What a great capture!! good light, good clarity of the little buzzers, however I wish I knew what that green thing was and could see all of their bodies. But, this is a great job either way. :)  8 cthenk</td>', 'What a great capture!! good light, good clarity of the little buzzers, however I wish I knew what that green thing was and could see all of their bodies. But, this is a great job either way. :)  8 cthenk', '2002-07-12 02:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83867, 3120, 878, '<td valign="top">I bet there was some fear when you got this close to them.</td>', 'I bet there was some fear when you got this close to them.', '2002-07-12 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83868, 3120, 2023, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, not so scary!</td>', 'Nice picture, not so scary!', '2002-07-13 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83869, 3120, 1169, '<td valign="top">a bit out of focus</td>', 'a bit out of focus', '2002-07-14 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83870, 3120, 2615, '<td valign="top">crisp, clear, very appropriate subject. my eyes are wandering a bit for the focal point.</td>', 'crisp, clear, very appropriate subject. my eyes are wandering a bit for the focal point.', '2002-07-14 04:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83871, 3120, 1078, '<td valign="top">So what did you attract them with?  If anything, this seems a trifle too bright, and I wish at least one of the wasps had been included completely in the crop.  At a guess, it looks like the autofocus caught the center of the shot because all the insects look slightly OOF -- some more than others.  The glare along the top of whatever the things is they''er on isn''t helping with the brightness problem, I think.</td>', 'So what did you attract them with?  If anything, this seems a trifle too bright, and I wish at least one of the wasps had been included completely in the crop.  At a guess, it looks like the autofocus caught the center of the shot because all the insects look slightly OOF -- some more than others.  The glare along the top of whatever the things is they''er on isn''t helping with the brightness problem, I think.', '2002-07-15 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83872, 3121, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice : )</td>', 'nice : )', '2002-07-08 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83873, 3121, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting if bizzare take.  Flames distort the letters too much, w/o the title the only clear letter is F.  I like the flames..... 7 Swash</td>', 'Interesting if bizzare take.  Flames distort the letters too much, w/o the title the only clear letter is F.  I like the flames..... 7 Swash', '2002-07-08 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83874, 3121, 117, '<td valign="top">must be a lawyer</td>', 'must be a lawyer', '2002-07-08 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83875, 3121, 1944, '<td valign="top">Good idea. the flame is overexposed and burned out though (pardon the pun), which lessens the visual impact.</td>', 'Good idea. the flame is overexposed and burned out though (pardon the pun), which lessens the visual impact.', '2002-07-08 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83876, 3121, 772, '<td valign="top">good shot!  Fire is fear :) = 6 - jmsetzler</td>', 'good shot!  Fire is fear :) = 6 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-08 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83877, 3121, 2380, '<td valign="top">would be better if fire was less vigorous</td>', 'would be better if fire was less vigorous', '2002-07-09 04:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83878, 3121, 2140, '<td valign="top">i know another really effective method to write in flame. i''m thinking of using it for the ''free study'' challenge.</td>', 'i know another really effective method to write in flame. i''m thinking of using it for the ''free study'' challenge.', '2002-07-09 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(83879, 3121, 2370, '<td valign="top">very nice interpretation of "fear", literally :)</td>', 'very nice interpretation of "fear", literally :)', '2002-07-09 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
