(83888, 3121, 1280, '<td valign="top">hmmmmmmmm  Can''t quite make out what it spells.  Interesting shot though.</td>', 'hmmmmmmmm  Can''t quite make out what it spells.  Interesting shot though.', '2002-07-10 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
