(83892, 3121, 1379, '<td valign="top">The fact that this is a pizza box makes me smile!  I like the purples you caught in the flames.  Quite glorious.</td>', 'The fact that this is a pizza box makes me smile!  I like the purples you caught in the flames.  Quite glorious.', '2002-07-14 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
