(84049, 3128, 2199, '<td valign="top">Great idea -- nice colors, and I like the "shape" of the shadowy person -- a tighter focus would have moved this to the top of the heap.</td>', 'Great idea -- nice colors, and I like the "shape" of the shadowy person -- a tighter focus would have moved this to the top of the heap.', '2002-07-08 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84050, 3128, 1280, '<td valign="top">don''t get it???</td>', 'don''t get it???', '2002-07-08 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84051, 3128, 1569, '<td valign="top">The focus needs help, thr reflection would have worked better.</td>', 'The focus needs help, thr reflection would have worked better.', '2002-07-08 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84052, 3128, 1759, '<td valign="top">Nice colors for establishing some contrast and setting the mood. I understand the artistic blur, but feel that it is a bit overdone to the point that it is difficult to find the subject in the background. Having said that, I like the photo causes the eye to flip between the foreground and background.</td>', 'Nice colors for establishing some contrast and setting the mood. I understand the artistic blur, but feel that it is a bit overdone to the point that it is difficult to find the subject in the background. Having said that, I like the photo causes the eye to flip between the foreground and background.', '2002-07-08 22:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84053, 3128, 1944, '<td valign="top">Very interesting treatment of this fear. It might have been a little more effective if the color of the skin on the lower lid was more normal. As it is it''s a good almost abstract design, but it doesn''t tell your story with enough power.</td>', 'Very interesting treatment of this fear. It might have been a little more effective if the color of the skin on the lower lid was more normal. As it is it''s a good almost abstract design, but it doesn''t tell your story with enough power.', '2002-07-08 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84054, 3128, 436, '<td valign="top">It wasn''t until I walked away from the computer with your image on full size that I really got it.  Somehow, sitting at the keyboard, it seems mostly blurry to me.  The colors are astonishing.  And now that I can see the reaper in the eye, it has more meaning.  Perhaps you''ve gotten too tight and the reflection is too subtle for a high ranking.</td>', 'It wasn''t until I walked away from the computer with your image on full size that I really got it.  Somehow, sitting at the keyboard, it seems mostly blurry to me.  The colors are astonishing.  And now that I can see the reaper in the eye, it has more meaning.  Perhaps you''ve gotten too tight and the reflection is too subtle for a high ranking.', '2002-07-09 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84055, 3128, 2310, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept.  The reflection is great but I would like to see the actual eye more defined.</td>', 'Excellent concept.  The reflection is great but I would like to see the actual eye more defined.', '2002-07-09 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84056, 3128, 2140, '<td valign="top">is that an eye?<br/>its out of focus and I can''t make it out.</td>', 'is that an eye?its out of focus and I can''t make it out.', '2002-07-09 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84057, 3128, 1, '<td valign="top">I really have no clue what I''m looking at.  Looks like there could be a computer monitor in there somewhere.  It''s just not fearful.</td>', 'I really have no clue what I''m looking at.  Looks like there could be a computer monitor in there somewhere.  It''s just not fearful.', '2002-07-09 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
