(84199, 3133, 2667, '<td valign="top">Evocative photo. Some may find it a bit dull (though I applaud the use of B&amp;W). However, for me,  it does one of the better jobs of any photo I have seen for "fear". The lilly, I think, is key. Well done.</td>', 'Evocative photo. Some may find it a bit dull (though I applaud the use of B&W). However, for me,  it does one of the better jobs of any photo I have seen for "fear". The lilly, I think, is key. Well done.', '2002-07-12 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
