(84229, 3134, 472, '<td valign="top">i think the darkness is a good idea but there are conventions for conveying the idea of ''darkness'' without making a picture that is difficult to see.  spotlights on important details, work, and shadows from interesting angles. mag 99</td>', 'i think the darkness is a good idea but there are conventions for conveying the idea of ''darkness'' without making a picture that is difficult to see.  spotlights on important details, work, and shadows from interesting angles. mag 99', '2002-07-11 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
