(84442, 3147, 2079, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot. I like the distance from the subject and great DOF. Spiders tend to provoke fear, but this spider looks almost jolly.  (I didnt dock you for Jolly). Great capture and I like the way the background fades off into the distance.</td>', 'Terrific shot. I like the distance from the subject and great DOF. Spiders tend to provoke fear, but this spider looks almost jolly.  (I didnt dock you for Jolly). Great capture and I like the way the background fades off into the distance.', '2002-07-10 02:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
