(84444, 3147, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a cool looking spider :)  I wonder if you could have cropped him out and made him a larger part of the image?  The positioning of this little guy is almost too close to the center of the frame considering his size in the image.  I would have tried to create a crop where he was positioned on one of the third line intersections for a little more impact :) = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a cool looking spider :)  I wonder if you could have cropped him out and made him a larger part of the image?  The positioning of this little guy is almost too close to the center of the frame considering his size in the image.  I would have tried to create a crop where he was positioned on one of the third line intersections for a little more impact :) = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-07-10 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
