(84464, 3148, 811, '<td valign="top">I''m really sorry, but this doll looks, well, innocent and almost regal.  Am I missing something totally obvious?  It is an excellent picture, good focus and lighting, etc.  Maybe if you could have put it in a setting to show the "evilness" of it, or something like that.  karmat</td>', 'I''m really sorry, but this doll looks, well, innocent and almost regal.  Am I missing something totally obvious?  It is an excellent picture, good focus and lighting, etc.  Maybe if you could have put it in a setting to show the "evilness" of it, or something like that.  karmat', '2002-07-08 23:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
