(84471, 3148, 2337, '<td valign="top">I guess you need to know this doll to know she''s evil.  A brat? Sure, I see that. But evil? I would have liked it better without the white spot in upper right background, but that''s just me (and I''m not sure it could be controlled).</td>', 'I guess you need to know this doll to know she''s evil.  A brat? Sure, I see that. But evil? I would have liked it better without the white spot in upper right background, but that''s just me (and I''m not sure it could be controlled).', '2002-07-10 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
