(84479, 3148, 878, '<td valign="top">hmm well its not as evil as some dolls.  I think there could of been some different lighting effects to produce more effect on this.  Perhaps if the dolls face was only lit from below, maybe a red light.  Good detail in the photo and nice colors.<br/></td>', 'hmm well its not as evil as some dolls.  I think there could of been some different lighting effects to produce more effect on this.  Perhaps if the dolls face was only lit from below, maybe a red light.  Good detail in the photo and nice colors.', '2002-07-12 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
