(84481, 3148, 1078, '<td valign="top">Yes, I know -- personal interprettion of fear....  This one doesn''t work for me.  Not because of the idea, but because of the doll you chose.  One of the Twilight Zones that freaks me out the most is one with an evil doll that ends up killing a man.  If you could have found a freakier looking doll (not necessarily a Chuckie, understand) I''d have gone along with this.  But this one looks too Shirley Temple to me.</td>', 'Yes, I know -- personal interprettion of fear....  This one doesn''t work for me.  Not because of the idea, but because of the doll you chose.  One of the Twilight Zones that freaks me out the most is one with an evil doll that ends up killing a man.  If you could have found a freakier looking doll (not necessarily a Chuckie, understand) I''d have gone along with this.  But this one looks too Shirley Temple to me.', '2002-07-14 19:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(84482, 3148, 2, '<td valign="top">I think we''re really stretching with this one... couldn''t we have gotten a dolly that looked even remotely frightening?  The image itself seems like it needs more light to me.</td>', 'I think we''re really stretching with this one... couldn''t we have gotten a dolly that looked even remotely frightening?  The image itself seems like it needs more light to me.', '2002-07-14 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
